{"parentUuid":"7b16625e-4d01-4e76-9bb1-b162b2f191d1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdHfvms9CWXM9jAcsahgf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Jf5M2A9BKq7MLHnTuihSsb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(resolver): emit diagnostics for every silent Opaque degradation\n\nAdversarial review finding: several PropType::Opaque construction\nsites across the resolver never pushed a Diagnostic, violating the\nproject's own \"never fail silently\" rule and leaving no trace when a\ncomponent's props silently lost information.\n\nFour sites fixed:\n\n- alias.rs's resolve_base_as_chain matched only Named/AtFile/\n  Intersection/Object/Union and fell through a wildcard for every\n  other CollectedType variant (IndexedAccess, Function, Conditional,\n  Mapped, TemplateLiteral, KeyOf, TypeOf, Raw, every primitive) —\n  silently dropping that member's contribution to the props chain.\n  Replaced with an exhaustive match (compiler now forces a decision on\n  any future CollectedType variant) that emits a diagnostic for\n  variants that can never provide a chain.\n\n- resolve_known's Opaque results (ThemingProps, StylesApiProps, cva/tv\n  without discoverable variants, ...) never got a diagnostic at either\n  call site, since resolve_known itself has no diagnostics channel\n  (known.rs must not depend on resolver). Added a shared\n  push_known_opaque_diagnostic helper, called from both named.rs and\n  chain.rs right after matching an Opaque result.\n\n- collected.rs's four inline Opaque constructions (KeyOf, Conditional,\n  Mapped, the complex Raw-string fallback) each now push an Info\n  diagnostic before degrading.\n\nAll three are pure additions — no PropType output changed, only new\ndiagnostic entries. Confirmed via snapshot diff (chakra, mantine,\nrdt-compat all show clean additions of the exact new messages, no\nother change) before regenerating.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10\ngit log --oneline -10"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":568,"cache_read_input_tokens":632167,"output_tokens":755,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":568,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":755,"cache_read_input_tokens":632167,"cache_creation_input_tokens":568,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":568},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdHfviSmQTY4E71qGB3bf","type":"assistant","uuid":"b502307e-268a-4526-bc13-cad7f0e03540","timestamp":"2026-07-22T19:46:38.325Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
