{"parentUuid":"a770494c-ac2a-4856-8ffd-6b641ad3e521","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"eafe5a33-2a2e-4a79-89fc-581673fb3b40","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01383VLsLQXUiysKcMi32PEv","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t//! Import resolution map — built from `GlobalSourceData`, used read-only during resolution.\n2\t//!\n3\t//! Answers the question: \"in file F, the name N was imported — what specifier and\n4\t//! canonical name does it refer to?\"  Actual path resolution (specifier → absolute\n5\t//! path) is left to the caller via `oxc_resolver`.\n6\t\n7\tuse camino::{Utf8Path, Utf8PathBuf};\n8\tuse compact_str::CompactString;\n9\tuse rustc_hash::FxHashMap;\n10\t\n11\tuse crate::types::{GlobalSourceData, LexedExport};\n12\t\n13\t// ─── Public Types ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n14\t\n15\t/// Where an imported name comes from, as written in the source."}]},"uuid":"1c60792a-1348-4ea8-a3eb-6d290db16170","timestamp":"2026-07-22T20:52:56.045Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/crates/core/src/import_map.rs","content":"//! Import resolution map — built from `GlobalSourceData`, used read-only during resolution.\n//!\n//! Answers the question: \"in file F, the name N was imported — what specifier and\n//! canonical name does it refer to?\"  Actual path resolution (specifier → absolute\n//! path) is left to the caller via `oxc_resolver`.\n\nuse camino::{Utf8Path, Utf8PathBuf};\nuse compact_str::CompactString;\nuse rustc_hash::FxHashMap;\n\nuse crate::types::{GlobalSourceData, LexedExport};\n\n// ─── Public Types ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n/// Where an imported name comes from, as written in the source.","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":366}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a770494c-ac2a-4856-8ffd-6b641ad3e521","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/U