{"parentUuid":"cd5d6723-6b38-4171-bbe5-85bde2bfa701","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdHn1yMnUMJ8Jnbw6H5tP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NrdtRkaKTStiPEHVRnYugv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nrefactor: dedupe TS-utility-type list, kill dead branches, fix a real serde gap\n\nSix independent small cleanups from the adversarial review's low-severity\ncluster:\n\n- chain.rs and named.rs each maintained their own copy of TypeScript's\n  built-in utility type names (Omit, Pick, Partial, ...) with no guard\n  against the two drifting apart. Extracted resolver::is_ts_utility_type()\n  as the single source of truth. known.rs's own subset of the same list\n  returned None for every arm anyway (identical to its wildcard fallback)\n  — removed as pure noise.\n\n- primitives.rs's `(string & {})` intersection special-case was strictly\n  redundant with the very next branch (single non-empty member resolves\n  the same way either way) — removed the dead special-case.\n\n- extractor/interface.rs's try_collect_cva_call allocated an owned String\n  for the callee name before checking whether it even matched a known\n  variant-function name — compare against &str first, no allocation for\n  the common non-match case.\n\n- CollectedObjectField's hand-rolled Serialize/Deserialize (~68 lines)\n  turned out to be unreachable dead code: CollectedType's own manual\n  to_json_value/from_json_value build this struct's fields directly and\n  never call it. Worse, its Deserialize only implemented visit_map, so\n  the one thing that WOULD call it — rmp_serde's default positional\n  (array) encoding, used directly on this type — panicked with \"invalid\n  type: sequence, expected struct CollectedObjectField\". Replaced with\n  a derive, which handles both representations correctly; proven by a\n  new round-trip test exercising the type directly (RED without the\n  fix, GREEN with it).\n\n- pipeline/mod.rs's \"canonicalize src_dirs[0] to resolve @types/react /\n  lib.d.ts against\" logic was copy-pasted at two call sites. Extracted\n  canonicalize_first_src_dir(), each caller keeping its own fallback\n  behavior (default to \".\" vs. skip entirely).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -20\ngit log --oneline -5"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_read_input_tokens":263253,"output_tokens":820,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":485,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":820,"cache_read_input_tokens":263253,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":485},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdHn1vzerVYjEmKG4Qkf5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ad1cfdb3-f534-4c47-8eaa-4d306dbcf570","timestamp":"2026-07-22T21:06:30.213Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
