{"parentUuid":"dc204286-99f0-434e-b51c-659ae030c42b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdHnehpBfNCBwkJYhoETr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WgZyUB95jxK7vrmvNQe8xJ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(consumer-surface): correct hand-maintained NAPI types, wire up vite-plugin options\n\ncrates/binding/src/lib.rs: TryFrom<JsExtractOptions> hand-built every\ndefault value instead of starting from PipelineOptions::default() and\noverriding — duplicated already-centralized defaults with real drift\nrisk (e.g. its own hardcoded variant_functions list could silently\ndiverge from PipelineOptions::default()'s). Rewrote to the same\n\"default + override what's Some\" pattern cli/config.rs already uses.\n\nAlso: extraPathsJson/knownTypeOverridesJson silently swallowed a parse\nfailure via .ok() + unwrap_or_default(), discarding a user's monorepo\npath aliases or type overrides with zero indication anything went\nwrong. Both now return a real error through the existing Result plumbing\n(crates/core/CLAUDE.md non-negotiable #6 — never fail silently).\n\npackages/napi/index.d.ts (hand-maintained, not codegen'd): Diagnostic's\nfile/line/column/help were typed as optional (`?:`), but the real Rust\nstruct has no skip_serializing_if, so these keys are always present in\nthe JSON with `null` — `field?: T` promises an absent key that never\nhappens; corrected to `T | null`. ExtractionStats was also missing\ndtsFilesParsed entirely, which the Rust struct has always emitted.\n\npackages/vite-plugin/src/index.ts:\n- skipHtmlProps had no corresponding NAPI field — silently ignored no\n  matter what a consumer set it to. Now maps to the real htmlAttributes:\n  'none' option.\n- configureServer (where cold extraction ran) is dev-server-only; Vite\n  never calls it during `vite build`, so a production build's virtual\n  module always resolved to the empty placeholder stats declared at\n  plugin construction. Added a buildStart hook that runs the same cold\n  extraction when command === 'build'. Fixing index.d.ts's ExtractionStats\n  surfaced that the placeholder itself was also missing dtsFilesParsed —\n  fixed alongside.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -20\ngit log --oneline -6"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":339,"cache_read_input_tokens":326102,"output_tokens":849,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":339,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":849,"cache_read_input_tokens":326102,"cache_creation_input_tokens":339,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":339},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdHneeVkbPZyFzYkEK7VD","type":"assistant","uuid":"1a40f733-8f49-46fd-a84f-1124e3ce4a7f","timestamp":"2026-07-22T21:14:50.115Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"1a40f733-8f49-46fd-a84f-1124e3ce4a7f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"eafe5a33-2a2e-4a79-89fc-581673fb3b40","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WgZyUB95jxK7vrmvNQe8xJ","type":"tool_result","content":"          └── windows-sys v0.59.0\n              └── rustix v0.38.44\n                  └── crossterm v0.28.1\n                      └── oxc-react-docgen v0.1.0\n    ├ windows_x86_64_msvc v0.53.1\n      └── windows-targets v0.53.5\n          └── windows-sys v0.60.2\n              └── notify v8.2.0\n                  └── watchexec v8.2.0\n                      └── oxc-react-docgen v0.1.0\n\nwarning[unnecessary-skip]: skip 'oxc_str' applied to a crate with only one version\n   ┌─ /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/deny.toml:31:15\n   │\n31 │     { name = \"oxc_str\" },\n   │               ━━━━━━━ unnecessary skip configuration\n\nadvisories ok, bans ok, licenses ok, sources ok\n[main bd6a8f9] fix(consumer-surface): correct hand-maintained NAPI types, wire up vite-plugin options\n 4 files changed, 198 insertions(+), 62 deletions(-)\nbd6a8f9 fix(consumer-surface): correct hand-maintained NAPI types, wire up vite-plugin options\nb50fa0b refactor: dedupe TS-utility-type list, kill dead branches, fix a real serde gap\nc11130a feat(resolver): wire up barrel/re-export chain resolution, drop dead diagnostic codes\n2b75917 refactor(diagnostics): shared io_read_error constructor, drop internal jargon, cheaper grouping\nd4649be fix(resolver): correct mistagged OpaqueReason variants and consolidate diagnostics\ncc2ff97 perf(resolver): drop two unnecessary interface clones, bump cache schema","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e98e6568-af12-494a-8a7e-c360a5352ade","timestamp":"2026-07-22T21:14:53.285Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"          └── windows-sys v0.59.0\n              └── rustix v0.38.44\n                  └── crossterm v0.28.1\n                      └── oxc-react-docgen v0.1.0\n    ├ windows_x86_64_msvc v0.53.1\n      └── windows-targets v0.53.5\n          └── windows-sys v0.60.2\n              └── notify v8.2.0\n                  └── watchexec v8.2.0\n                      └── oxc-react-docgen v0.1.0\n\nwarning[unnecessary-skip]: skip 'oxc_str' applied to a crate with only one version\n   ┌─ /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/deny.toml:31:15\n   │\n31 │     { name = \"oxc_str\" },\n   │               ━━━━━━━ unnecessary skip configuration\n\nadvisories ok, bans ok, licenses ok, sources ok\n[main bd6a8f9] fix(consumer-surface): correct hand-maintained NAPI types, wire up vite-plugin options\n 4 files changed, 198 insertions(+), 62 deletions(-)\nbd6a8f9 fix(consumer-surface): correct hand-maintained NAPI types, wire up vite-plugin options\nb50fa0b refactor: dedupe TS-utility-type list, kill dead branches, fix a real serde gap\nc11130a feat(resolver): wire up barrel/re-export chain resolution, drop dead diagnostic codes\n2b75917 refactor(diagnostics): shared io_read_error constructor, drop internal jargon, cheaper grouping\nd4649be fix(resolver): correct mistagged OpaqueReason variants and consolidate diagnostics\ncc2ff97 perf(resolver): drop two unnecessary interface clones, bump cache schema","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"gitOperation":{"commit":{"sha":"bd6a8f9","kind":"committed"}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1a40f733-8f49-46fd-a84f-1124e3ce4a7f","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
