_eq!(round_tripped.description, \"the label\");","numLines":15,"startLine":738,"totalLines":755}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"77167509-c166-4446-a874-a66b9e20bd86","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
