{"parentUuid":"6dbd974c-5571-4693-a4cd-ce1c392e73aa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdHnoxbRpMENds56EiMoh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 44 findings from the adversarial-analysis workflow are now addressed, across 6 commits this session:\n\n- **`d4649be`** — fixed 2 mistagged `OpaqueReason` variants, corrected a misleading diagnostic message, consolidated 3 drifted `MaxDepthExceeded` diagnostic constructions into one shared helper\n- **`2b75917`** — shared `Diagnostic::io_read_error()` constructor (was duplicated verbatim), dropped internal \"scoped key\" jargon from a user-facing message, made diagnostic grouping compare by value instead of allocating a debug-format string per diagnostic\n- **`c11130a`** — wired up barrel/re-export chain resolution (`export { X } from './x'`, `export * from './x'`) that was fully built and unit-tested but never actually called — a real gap for any real component library's `index.ts` pattern; removed 4 confirmed-dead `DiagnosticCode` variants\n- **`b50fa0b`** — deduped an independently-maintained TS-utility-type list between `chain.rs`/`named.rs`, removed a dead intersection special-case and a redundant match arm, avoided a needless allocation in cva-call detection, and replaced `CollectedObjectField`'s 68-line hand-rolled serde impl with a derive — which turned out to fix a real bug (its `Deserialize` only implemented `visit_map`, so direct msgpack use would have panicked)\n- **`bd6a8f9`** — `binding/lib.rs` now builds from `PipelineOptions::default()` instead of hand-duplicating every default; malformed `extraPathsJson`/`knownTypeOverridesJson` now hard-error instead of silently discarding user config; fixed `packages/napi/index.d.ts`'s `Diagnostic` fields (typed optional but always present as `null`) and missing `dtsFilesParsed`; fixed the vite-plugin's `skipHtmlProps` (previously a no-op) and a real bug where production `vite build` never ran cold extraction at all\n- **`c1d87d4`** — small clippy fix caught only under `--all-targets`\n\nEvery batch went through full TDD (RED confirmed before each fix), the complete workspace test suite (158 core + 21 CLI + 8 snapshot + 4 binding, all green, no snapshot diffs), `clippy --all-targets -D warnings` clean, and real-fixture verification across all 21 fixtures with fresh caches.\n\nOne thing worth flagging: `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-25-phase6-integration-tests.md` and `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-07-adversarial-analysis-fixes.md` are still sitting untracked from before this conversation — they predate this session's work and I left them alone since they weren't mine to clean up, but let me know if you want them committed or removed."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":493,"cache_read_input_tokens":336331,"output_tokens":961,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":493,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":961,"cache_read_input_tokens":336331,"cache_creation_input_tokens":493,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":493},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdHnouj3QB9RbgXBExx6b","type":"assistant","uuid":"1cfe8ad8-e482-4782-b298-09bdd9d45298","timestamp":"2026-07-22T21:16:55.805Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
