{"parentUuid":"892a4c27-a5e1-45be-acbe-a44a295ef7b6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"144398b4-81f5-48c7-a802-b20acfd023de","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UY5hFTnRYPmEaV7gofiwYv","type":"tool_result","content":"=== apps/validate check ===\nbaselines\nnode_modules\nsrc\nmoon.yml\npackage.json\nlanguage: typescript\n\ntasks:\n  compare:\n    command: pnpm compare:all\n    deps:\n      - \"cli:build\"\n    inputs:\n      - \"src/**/*\"\n    options:\n      cache: false\n=== git log around structural-gap-fixes & adversarial-fixes ===\n5a458fd fix(validate): read PropType fields by name instead of array index\n6229577 build(cli): add @oxc-react-docgen/cli as a thin exec wrapper, not a reimplementation\n704be77 build(napi): scaffold multi-platform release pipeline (untested, workflow_dispatch only)\na2d745c fix(binding): un-alias napi::Result to fix broken generated TypeScript types\n2b52c72 docs: fix README install claims; add RDT migration guide\n0924222 fix(output): preserve event handler parameter names instead of a hardcoded placeholder\nbc9b0fe docs(cli): document check's distinct exit-1-for-strict-warnings path\nbf34e20 fix(pipeline): don't treat an empty src_dirs list as \"all configured dirs missing\"; regenerate snapshots\n01433ed fix(cli): hard-error on unsupported config files; validate --src exists; keep stdout pure JSON by default\nb51750d fix(core): canonicalize discovered file paths; remove non-test unwrap() calls; avoid per-lookup path clone in import_map\n9a93673 fix(output): match RDT's methods/tags/enum conventions; name tuple PropType JSON fields\n21062e8 fix(pipeline): surface watch-mode diagnostics; extract inline object type aliases\n2dc1271 fix(resolver): union conflicting prop types across discriminated-union members; precompute enum lookup for typeof/variant-props\n07f294b fix(extractor): capture destructured param defaults in forwardRef and FC-typed components\n5adfff7 perf(extractor): replace O(n²) JSDoc comment scan with binary search; fix interface description ordering\nf5dcbb2 fix(extractor): guard against unbounded parser recursion; surface parse errors; extract inline object props\n921084e fix(extractor): synthesize anonymous alias for inline union/intersection in forwardRef\nfc9427e chore: drop stale RUSTSEC-2026-0190 ignore; regenerate all snapshots\n183e820 feat(extractor): handle Readonly<T> as transparent alias\n3a632b1 fix(extractor): extract TSMethodSignature params instead of hardcoding ellipsis\ned52f5a fix(extractor): track consumed JSDoc comments to prevent description leaks\n4b68c84 fix(resolver): resolve Pick/Omit/Partial in extends position; scan all members for discriminant\n23eb858 feat(react-types): recognize SVGAttributes, HTMLProps, ComponentRef, JSXElementConstructor\ne1c8316 fix(resolver): include non-Named union members; handle Union base type in resolve_base_as_chain\nea691ec fix(resolver): remove duplicate InheritedLayer from ComponentPropsWithoutRef return\nc47c2db fix(resolver): merge_parent uses or_insert for inherited_by_name (child wins over grandparent)\n56f32c9 docs: adversarial analysis report, structural gap fixes plan, type-checker integration\n21a0778 fix(validate): per-component keys, notableInherited classification, release binary\n6dc45ed test(fixtures): add rdt-compat jsdoc, memo, types fixtures\n93593d3 fix(resolver): recognize TS primitive keywords in Raw tuple elements\n95d2667 docs(coverage): update matrix with new fixture findings and bugs\ndd1d9b8 test(fixtures): add controlled, pick-source, discriminated-union rdt-compat fixtures\nbded542 fix(extractor): read recipe config from arg 0 for non-cva callees\n30d473f chore: moon tasks — test/bench/coverage, fix lint/deny flags, just ci recipe\n5d9787b chore: CI — nextest, llvm-cov, cargo-deny, coverage, cancel-in-progress\nd168ae2 chore: CI matrix — Node 24/26, npm/pnpm install test, pin Rust 1.96\n06182ba docs: README, CONTRIBUTING, ARCHITECTURE\nc4de574 chore: update pnpm-lock — apps/validate rename, vite-plugin deps\n5b2de17 chore: rustfmt max_width 120, clippy too-many-lines 150, drop stale napi/rolldown artifacts\n12f39ad feat: Phase 6 — validate compare harness with moon run validate:compare\nddebb6b fix: Phase 5a — session leak, isSrcFile prefix collision, moon wiring, docs\ncd80284 feat: Phase 5a — @oxc-react-docgen/vite-plugin with HMR, virtual module, 14 tests\n464c58d feat: packages/napi — dev binary loader, TypeScript types\nd4e3563 chore: Phase 5a prep — rename crates/napi→binding, move validate→apps, drop rolldown plugin\n982783e docs: Phase 5a — Vite plugin spec, implementation plan\nb151fef fix: async NAPI extraction functions, WatchSession concurrent access guard\nef1360d refactor: R12-R17 — deny(unsafe_code), error traits, must_use, pre-commit hooks\necacb3b chore: moon 2.3.3, replace lefthook with native vcs hooks, exclude baselines from typos\n2a2ac9a chore: Claude Code setup — CLAUDE.md, skills\n216842a refactor: R1-R11 — module splits, ResolveState, IO errors, visibility\nd719c01 fix: post-Phase-4 accuracy — ComponentPropsWithoutRef, VariantProps, React.* builtins, WatchSession race, validate harness\nc0e8961 feat: Phase 4 — NAPI bindings, CLI\ne5c46f2 feat: Phase 3 — resolver, pipeline, DTS cache\n6f06579 refactor: pre-Phase-3 architecture overhaul\n08ee071 feat: Phase 2 — OXC AST extractor, import map, known patterns\n93a7d71 feat: scaffold oxc-react-docgen workspace","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"aa20d8ab-0bd3-4d6e-9eb8-41184c111e61","timestamp":"2026-07-22T23:43:26.192Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== apps/validate check ===\nbaselines\nnode_modules\nsrc\nmoon.yml\npackage.json\nlanguage: typescript\n\ntasks:\n  compare:\n    command: pnpm compare:all\n    deps:\n      - \"cli:build\"\n    inputs:\n      - \"src/**/*\"\n    options:\n      cache: false\n=== git log around structural-gap-fixes & adversarial-fixes ===\n5a458fd fix(validate): read PropType fields by name instead of array index\n6229577 build