{"parentUuid":"afc7b533-874e-4799-bc66-8192996a53ac","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ11iqBfArC4bgYwXU1s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01T7WUjrKgedbKAmN1GPbAyq","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/STATUS.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":354799,"output_tokens":316,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":316,"cache_read_input_tokens":354799,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ11gGeaPWi6n79b39zC","type":"assistant","uuid":"d2c8d928-9dba-482f-ba34-3bf0a21f75aa","timestamp":"2026-07-22T23:56:49.721Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"d2c8d928-9dba-482f-ba34-3bf0a21f75aa","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2faa95fa-a27b-440f-bd61-e43ec8cb56fa","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T7WUjrKgedbKAmN1GPbAyq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Status\n2\t\n3\t**Updated:** 2026-07-21\n4\t\n5\tCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are\n6\ttested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode\n7\tare fully implemented — not stubs, despite what older docs in this repo used\n8\tto say. If you find another doc contradicting this file, this file wins.\n9\t\n10\t## Numbers\n11\t\n12\t- 163 Rust tests (16 cli + 139 core unit + 8 snapshot), 14 vitest — all green\n13\t- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean\n14\t- 15 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`\n15\t  (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ark-ui, base-ui,\n16\t  blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda, react-resizable-panels,\n17\t  storybook-emotion, tanstack-table, zendesk-garden — see `rdt-coverage.md`)\n18\t\n19\t## What's not built yet\n20\t\n21\t- **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`\n22\t  bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed.\n23\t- **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.\n24\t\n25\t## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker\n26\t\n27\tSee the \"Known gaps summary\" table in `rdt-coverage.md` for the full,\n28\tmaintained list. The short version: conditional types, mapped types over an\n29\tunbound generic, and a couple of `@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes all\n30\tneed real type inference OXC deliberately doesn't do. Not bugs, not on the\n31\troadmap unless typescript-go's Corsa API stabilizes (see\n32\t`type-checker-integration.md`).\n33\t\n34\t## Where to look next\n35\t\n36\t- **What broke and why, historically** → `rdt-coverage.md` — every bug found\n37\t  during real-library validation, root cause, and the fix. Keep this updated;\n38\t  it's the project's memory.\n39\t- **How the pipeline fits together** → `ARCHITECTURE.md`\n40\t- **Setup, testing, code style, commit conventions** → `CONTRIBUTING.md`\n41\t- **Migrating from react-docgen-typescript** → `MIGRATING.md`\n42\t- **Old build-out specs, resolved questions, point-in-time analyses** →\n43\t  `docs/archive/` — historical, not current, kept for reference\n44\t"}]},"uuid":"db79865e-2655-45b8-b9a2-66de8bc9ab8a","timestamp":"2026-07-22T23:56:49.801Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/STATUS.md","content":"# Status\n\n**Updated:** 2026-07-21\n\nCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are\ntested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode\nare fully implemented — not stubs, despite what older docs in this repo used\nto say. If you find another doc contradicting this file, this file wins.\n\n## Numbers\n\n- 163 Rust tests (16 cli + 139 core unit + 8 snapshot), 14 vitest — all green\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean\n- 15 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`\n  (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ark-ui, base-ui,\n  blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda, react-resizable-panels,\n  storybook-emotion, tanstack-table, zendesk-garden — see `rdt-coverage.md`)\n\n## What's not built yet\n\n- **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`\n  bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed.\n- **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.\n\n## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker\n\nSee the \"Known gaps summary\" table in `rdt-coverage.md` for the full,\nmaintained list. The short version: conditional types, mapped types over an\nunbound generic, and a couple of `@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes all\nneed real type inference OXC deliberately doesn't do. Not bugs, not on the\nroadmap unless typescript-go's Corsa API stabilizes (see\n`type-checker-integration.md`).\n\n## Where to look next\n\n- **What broke and why, historically** → `rdt-coverage.md` — every bug found\n  during real-library validation, root cause, and the fix. Keep this updated;\n  it's the project's memory.\n- **How the pipeline fits together** → `ARCHITECTURE.md`\n- **Setup, testing, code style, commit conventions** → `CONTRIBUTING.md`\n- **Migrating from react-docgen-typescript** → `MIGRATING.md`\n- **Old build-out specs, resolved questions, point-in-time analyses** →\n  `docs/archive/` — historical, not current, kept for reference\n","numLines":44,"startLine":1,"totalLines":44}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d2c8d928-9dba-482f-ba34-3bf0a21f75aa","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
