{"parentUuid":"22d84e68-2be9-4d35-bcde-98b2b7f1c5d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ14ASc6ZvZUVVGEvZYY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147,"cache_read_input_tokens":357738,"output_tokens":1670,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1670,"cache_read_input_tokens":357738,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ146F6eAjZViW8ZAg3J","type":"assistant","uuid":"707ee3a7-00ff-4077-adf8-585034c79420","timestamp":"2026-07-22T23:57:21.067Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"707ee3a7-00ff-4077-adf8-585034c79420","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ14ASc6ZvZUVVGEvZYY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Bk6Y1P1uZdFzeb1kjqTz4H","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/STATUS.md","old_string":"# Status\n\n**Updated:** 2026-07-21\n\nCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are\ntested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode\nare fully implemented — not stubs, despite what older docs in this repo used\nto say. If you find another doc contradicting this file, this file wins.\n\n## Numbers\n\n- 163 Rust tests (16 cli + 139 core unit + 8 snapshot), 14 vitest — all green\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean\n- 15 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`\n  (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ark-ui, base-ui,\n  blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda, react-resizable-panels,\n  storybook-emotion, tanstack-table, zendesk-garden — see `rdt-coverage.md`)\n\n## What's not built yet\n\n- **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`\n  bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed.\n- **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.\n\n## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker\n\nSee the \"Known gaps summary\" table in `rdt-coverage.md` for the full,\nmaintained list. The short version: conditional types, mapped types over an\nunbound generic, and a couple of `@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes all\nneed real type inference OXC deliberately doesn't do. Not bugs, not on the\nroadmap unless typescript-go's Corsa API stabilizes (see\n`type-checker-integration.md`).","new_string":"# Status\n\n**Updated:** 2026-07-22\n\nCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are\ntested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode\nare fully implemented — not stubs, despite what older docs in this repo used\nto say. If you find another doc contradicting this file, this file wins.\n\n## Numbers\n\n- 191 Rust tests (21 cli + 158 core unit + 8 snapshot + 4 napi binding), 18\n  vitest — all green\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean\n- 21 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`\n  (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ark-ui, base-ui,\n  blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda, react-final-form,\n  react-resizable-panels, storybook-emotion, tanstack-table, zendesk-garden —\n  see `rdt-coverage.md`)\n\n## What's not built yet\n\n- **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`\n  bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed.\n- **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.\n- **Barrel/re-export scoped-key allocation caching** — `resolver/chain.rs` /\n  `named.rs` / `template.rs` build a `\"{file}:{name}\"` scoped-key string on\n  every lookup. A `Borrow`-based type-map key would let lookups happen\n  without allocating. Real but unbenchmarked — do as a focused perf pass if\n  profiling shows it matters.\n- **DTS cache has no dirty-flag or size cap** (`cache.rs`) — rewrites the\n  whole cache file on every run regardless of whether anything changed, and\n  has no upper bound on how large the on-disk cache can grow. Low severity\n  (requires local write access, and an attacker with that already has better\n  options) — worth fixing for large monorepos before it becomes a real cost.\n\n## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker\n\nSee the \"Known gaps summary\" table in `rdt-coverage.md` for the full,\nmaintained list. The short version: conditional types, mapped types over an\nunbound generic, and a couple of `@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes all\nneed real type inference OXC deliberately doesn't do. Not bugs, not on the\nroadmap unless typescript-go's Corsa API stabilizes (see\n`type-checker-integration.md`)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147,"cache_read_input_tokens":357738,"output_tokens":1670,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1670,"cache_read_input_tokens":357738,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ146F6eAjZViW8ZAg3J","type":"assistant","uuid":"e4a6c5c6-1102-46a4-9c37-e150c7c03a76","timestamp":"2026-07-22T23:57:34.598Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"e4a6c5c6-1102-46a4-9c37-e150c7c03a76","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2faa95fa-a27b-440f-bd61-e43ec8cb56fa","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bk6Y1P1uZdFzeb1kjqTz4H","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/STATUS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"edeadd9e-40cc-4322-b626-4d5d1776276f","timestamp":"2026-07-22T23:57:34.733Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/STATUS.md","oldString":"# Status\n\n**Updated:** 2026-07-21\n\nCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are\ntested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode\nare fully implemented — not stubs, despite what older docs in this repo used\nto say. If you find another doc contradicting this file, this file wins.\n\n## Numbers\n\n- 163 Rust tests (16 cli + 139 core unit + 8 snapshot), 14 vitest — all green\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean\n- 15 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`\n  (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ark-ui, base-ui,\n  blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda, react-resizable-panels,\n  storybook-emotion, tanstack-table, zendesk-garden — see `rdt-coverage.md`)\n\n## What's not built yet\n\n- **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`\n  bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed.\n- **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.\n\n## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker\n\nSee the \"Known gaps summary\" table in `rdt-coverage.md` for the full,\nmaintained list. The short version: conditional types, mapped types over an\nunbound generic, and a couple of `@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes all\nneed real type inference OXC deliberately doesn't do. Not bugs, not on the\nroadmap unless typescript-go's Corsa API stabilizes (see\n`type-checker-integration.md`).","newString":"# Status\n\n**Updated:** 2026-07-22\n\nCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are\ntested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode\nare fully implemented — not stubs, despite what older docs in this repo used\nto say. If you find another doc contradicting this file, this file wins.\n\n## Numbers\n\n- 191 Rust tests (21 cli + 158 core unit + 8 snapshot + 4 napi binding), 18\n  vitest — all green\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean\n- 21 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`\n  (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ark-ui, base-ui,\n  blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda, react-final-form,\n  react-resizable-panels, storybook-emotion, tanstack-table, zendesk-garden —\n  see `rdt-coverage.md`)\n\n## What's not built yet\n\n- **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`\n  bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed.\n- **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.\n- **Barrel/re-export scoped-key allocation caching** — `resolver/chain.rs` /\n  `named.rs` / `template.rs` build a `\"{file}:{name}\"` scoped-key string on\n  every lookup. A `Borrow`-based type-map key would let lookups happen\n  without allocating. Real but unbenchmarked — do as a focused perf pass if\n  profiling shows it matters.\n- **DTS cache has no dirty-flag or size cap** (`cache.rs`) — rewrites the\n  whole cache file on every run regardless of whether anything changed, and\n  has no upper bound on how large the on-disk cache can grow. Low severity\n  (requires local write access, and an attacker with that already has better\n  options) — worth fixing for large monorepos before it becomes a real cost.\n\n## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker\n\nSee the \"Known gaps summary\" table in `rdt-coverage.md` for the full,\nmaintained list. The short version: conditional types, mapped types over an\nunbound generic, and a couple of `@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes all\nneed real type inference OXC deliberately doesn't do. Not bugs, not on the\nroadmap unless typescript-go's Corsa API stabilizes (see\n`type-checker-integration.md`).","originalFile":"# Status\n\n**Updated:** 2026-07-21\n\nCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are\ntested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode\nare fully implemented — not stubs, despite what older docs in this repo used\nto say. If you find another doc contradicting this file, this file wins.\n\n## Numbers\n\n- 163 Rust tests (16 cli + 139 core unit + 8 snapshot), 14 vitest — all green\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean\n- 15 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`\n  (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ark-ui, base-ui,\n  blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda, react-resizable-panels,\n  storybook-emotion, tanstack-table, zendesk-garden — see `rdt-coverage.md`)\n\n## What's not built yet\n\n- **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`\n  bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed.\n- **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.\n\n## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker\n\nSee the \"Known gaps summary\" table in `rdt-coverage.md` for the full,\nmaintained list. The short version: conditional types, mapped types over an\nunbound generic, and a couple of `@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes all\nneed real type inference OXC deliberately doesn't do. Not bugs, not on the\nroadmap unless typescript-go's Corsa API stabilizes (see\n`type-checker-integration.md`).\n\n## Where to look next\n\n- **What broke and why, historically** → `rdt-coverage.md` — every bug found\n  during real-library validation, root cause, and the fix. Keep this updated;\n  it's the project's memory.\n- **How the pipeline fits together** → `ARCHITECTURE.md`\n- **Setup, testing, code style, commit conventions** → `CONTRIBUTING.md`\n- **Migrating from react-docgen-typescript** → `MIGRATING.md`\n- **Old build-out specs, resolved questions, point-in-time analyses** →\n  `docs/archive/` — historical, not current, kept for reference\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":6,"lines":[" # Status"," ","-**Updated:** 2026-07-21","+**Updated:** 2026-07-22"," "," Core extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are"," tested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode"]},{"oldStart":9,"oldLines":18,"newStart":9,"newLines":30,"lines":[" "," ## Numbers"," ","-- 163 Rust tests (16 cli + 139 core unit + 8 snapshot), 14 vitest — all green","+- 191 Rust tests (21 cli + 158 core unit + 8 snapshot + 4 napi binding), 18","+  vitest — all green"," - `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean","-- 15 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`","+- 21 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`","   (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ark-ui, base-ui,","-  blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda, react-resizable-panels,","-  storybook-emotion, tanstack-table, zendesk-garden — see `rdt-coverage.md`)","+  blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda, react-final-form,","+  react-resizable-panels, storybook-emotion, tanstack-table, zendesk-garden —","+  see `rdt-coverage.md`)"," "," ## What's not built yet"," "," - **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`","   bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed."," - **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.","+- **Barrel/re-export scoped-key allocation caching** — `resolver/chain.rs` /","+  `named.rs` / `template.rs` build a `\"{file}:{name}\"` scoped-key string on","+  every lookup. A `Borrow`-based type-map key would let lookups happen","+  without allocating. Real but unbenchmarked — do as a focused perf pass if","+  profiling shows it matters.","+- **DTS cache has no dirty-flag or size cap** (`cache.rs`) — rewrites the","+  whole cache file on every run regardless of whether anything changed, and","+  has no upper bound on how large the on-disk cache can grow. Low severity","+  (requires local write access, and an attacker with that already has better","+  options) — worth fixing for large monorepos before it becomes a real cost."," "," ## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e4a6c5c6-1102-46a4-9c37-e150c7c03a76","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
