{"parentUuid":"03a0243a-4bfb-4f8d-9ffc-6dd68043fda4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4a9674fb-a972-4853-9f41-80d247c8ddd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Let's tackle the adrs and make sure we have rules to appropriately document them. We want to keep them very eng focused so help contributors understand our decisions, friendly, scannable and easy to read. Devoid of AI slop and AI word salad or filler words. Not robotic please. If a template would be useful we should leverage that. We should make a skill that could be use by agents if possible right? Goal and outcome oriented, short, succint and without hard-coded thinking. We want that skill to be flexible, adapt and best leverage LLMs and agents."},"uuid":"2d93fb8d-67fc-4c7a-bd90-c69f34d027cf","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:03:37.625Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
