{"parentUuid":"fc2530f7-bd5b-4b82-9204-d5eb4f35dc73","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4a9674fb-a972-4853-9f41-80d247c8ddd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gy9u279so1aMweVsneSsRW","type":"tool_result","content":"# Type Checker Integration: Future Work\n\nThis document describes which resolver gaps genuinely require a TypeScript type checker,\nthe state of the tsgo (TypeScript 7.0) ecosystem, and the integration plan for when the\nCorsa API is stable.\n\n---\n\n## What we can fix structurally (no type checker needed)\n\nThe six fundamental gap patterns discovered during the RDT compatibility audit break into\ntwo groups:\n\n**Fixable now — pure AST/structural:**\n\n| Gap | Root cause | Fix location |\n|-----|-----------|-------------|\n| TSMethodSignature param loss | Hardcoded `vec![Raw(\"...\")]` instead of reading `ms.params.items` | `extractor/mod.rs:359-374`, `476-492` |\n| React namespace recognition (SVGAttributes, etc.) | Missing entries in `is_react_builtin` and `html_element_for` | `react_types.rs`, `resolver/named.rs` |\n| `Readonly<T>` transparent wrapper | Missing arm in `extractor/alias.rs` | `extractor/alias.rs` |\n[128 more lines]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"a1a86e6e-3a01-4427-963d-fef6d69967c7","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:05:32.829Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Type Checker Integration: Future Work\n\nThis document describes which resolver gaps genuinely require a TypeScript type checker,\nthe state of the tsgo (TypeScript 7.0) ecosystem, and the integration plan for when the\nCorsa API is stable.\n\n---\n\n## What we can fix structurally (no type checker needed)\n\nThe six fundamental gap patterns discovered during the RDT compatibility audit break into\ntwo groups:\n\n**Fixable now — pure AST/structural:**\n\n| Gap | Root cause | Fix location |\n|-----|-----------|-------------|\n| TSMethodSignature param loss | Hardcoded `vec![Raw(\"...\")]` instead of reading `ms.params.items` | `extractor/mod.rs:359-374`, `476-492` |\n| React namespace recognition (SVGAttributes, etc.) | Missing entries in `is_react_builtin` and `html_element_for` | `react_types.rs`, `resolver/named.rs` |\n| `Readonly<T>` transparent wrapper | Missing arm in `extractor/alias.rs` | `extractor/alias.rs` |\n[128 more lines]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fc2530f7-bd5b-4b82-9204-d5eb4f35dc73","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
