{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"79f6a0d5-d208-49b9-8fa1-873197deed17","snapshotMessageId":"2d93fb8d-67fc-4c7a-bd90-c69f34d027cf","trackingPath":"docs/adr/0004-defer-type-checker-integration.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-07-23T00:10:02.570Z","realParentDir":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/adr"},"timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:10:02.588Z"}
{"parentUuid":"32d094c4-8cab-4fc2-b91b-310d0d0609a6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ225Cu5um3M77yoKdTe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Vnc7Dw91nkJBtCeof9cns9","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/adr/0004-defer-type-checker-integration.md","content":"# 0004. Defer full type-checker integration\n\n**Status:** Accepted\n**Date:** 2026-07-22 (retroactive)\n\n## Context\n\nOXC's structural, no-type-checking approach (`0001`) can't resolve\nconditional types, mapped types over an unbound generic, or a few\n`@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes — these need real type inference.\n`typescript-go` (TypeScript 7.0's Rust/Go port, \"Corsa\") is the plausible\nfuture path, but its public API for this isn't stable yet.\n\n## Decision\n\nDon't integrate a type checker now. Every gap that would need one degrades to\na `Diagnostic` plus an `Opaque` prop type instead of a wrong answer, and gets\ntracked in `docs/rdt-coverage.md`'s \"Known gaps summary\" table. Revisit when\nCorsa's API stabilizes.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- A real, bounded set of real-world types (see `docs/type-checker-integration.md`\n  for the current list) shows up as `Opaque` in extraction output until this\n  changes.\n- No dependency on an unstable, fast-moving API in the meantime.\n- The gap list needs to stay current in `docs/type-checker-integration.md`\n  and `docs/rdt-coverage.md` as new patterns get found — otherwise this ADR\n  quietly goes stale.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":826,"cache_read_input_tokens":399099,"output_tokens":563,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":826,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":563,"cache_read_input_tokens":399099,"cache_creation_input_tokens":826,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":826},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ21yqwHmgaiuVSkL8uh","type":"assistant","uuid":"79f6a0d5-d208-49b9-8fa1-873197deed17","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:10:02.566Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"79f6a0d5-d208-49b9-8fa1-873197deed17","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4a9674fb-a972-4853-9f41-80d247c8ddd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vnc7Dw91nkJBtCeof9cns9","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/adr/0004-defer-type-checker-integration.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"a0ca8181-a5c1-42db-8b61-52aaad5e85cc","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:10:02.657Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/adr/0004-defer-type-checker-integration.md","content":"# 0004. Defer full type-checker integration\n\n**Status:** Accepted\n**Date:** 2026-07-22 (retroactive)\n\n## Context\n\nOXC's structural, no-type-checking approach (`0001`) can't resolve\nconditional types, mapped types over an unbound generic, or a few\n`@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes — these need real type inference.\n`typescript-go` (TypeScript 7.0's Rust/Go port, \"Corsa\") is the plausible\nfuture path, but its public API for this isn't stable yet.\n\n## Decision\n\nDon't integrate a type checker now. Every gap that would need one degrades to\na `Diagnostic` plus an `Opaque` prop type instead of a wrong answer, and gets\ntracked in `docs/rdt-coverage.md`'s \"Known gaps summary\" table. Revisit when\nCorsa's API stabilizes.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- A real, bounded set of real-world types (see `docs/type-checker-integration.md`\n  for the current list) shows up as `Opaque` in extraction output until this\n  changes.\n- No dependency on an unstable, fast-moving API in the meantime.\n- The gap list needs to stay current in `docs/type-checker-integration.md`\n  and `docs/rdt-coverage.md` as new patterns get found — otherwise this ADR\n  quietly goes stale.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"79f6a0d5-d208-49b9-8fa1-873197deed17","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
