{"parentUuid":"12293847-5b0e-4cdc-b962-df2682f18a6d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ2JhhZRwCVFHvZn83cs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Qvgu45vvcLMGxntsWkZ6az","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\ndocs(adr): tighten scope to architectural decisions specifically\n\n\"Expensive to reverse and not obvious from the code\" was too broad on its\nown — plenty of hard-to-reverse things are implementation details, not\narchitecture. Added a second required gate: does it affect system\nstructure, a dependency/technology choice, a data contract, or a\ncross-cutting constraint? Both gates now required, not either.\n\nVerified the four existing ADRs still clear both gates unchanged.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10\ngit log --oneline -3"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":211,"cache_read_input_tokens":416684,"output_tokens":285,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":211,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":285,"cache_read_input_tokens":416684,"cache_creation_input_tokens":211,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":211},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ2JevNXPFCnpYGE8ueF","type":"assistant","uuid":"a257e707-aac0-47c5-abe2-8164a0468ab8","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:13:47.502Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
