{"parentUuid":"404b8b94-d207-4d2e-bd1f-c04b20a793c8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ34eyaDsJRTDTazFgyU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XYTshZKaiZ8om5G5nc6uKc","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/adr/0003-positional-msgpack-cache-encoding.md","content":"# 0003. Cache the DTS parse cache with positional (not named) MessagePack\n\n**Status:** Accepted\n**Date:** 2026-07-22 (retroactive)\n\n## Context\n\nThe DTS parse cache persists `SourceData` across runs so unchanged `.d.ts` files don't get re-parsed. `rmp_serde::to_vec`/`from_slice` — the default, and what this project uses — encode structs *positionally*: as an array of field values in declaration order, not a map of field names. A `_named` variant encodes as a map instead, at a size and speed cost we haven't needed to pay.\n\n## Decision\n\nUse plain `rmp_serde::to_vec`/`from_slice`, and treat `SourceData`'s field order as part of the wire format. A `CACHE_SCHEMA_VERSION` constant (`crates/core/src/cache.rs`) gets bumped whenever a field is added anywhere but the end of the struct, removed, or reordered — any change that would shift decode position for cache entries written before the change. A version mismatch discards the whole cache rather than risk decoding an old entry into the wrong field.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- Smaller, faster cache files than named encoding — the whole point.\n- Adding a field to `SourceData` (or anything it contains) requires remembering to bump `CACHE_SCHEMA_VERSION` if it isn't appended at the very end. Easy to forget — `const_arrays` (added mid-struct) is exactly the case this version bump was added to cover.\n- A forgotten bump doesn't fail loudly. It decodes as plausible-looking but wrong data — the worst kind of bug. There's no compiler check for this; it's a discipline problem, not a type-safety one.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":989,"cache_read_input_tokens":423475,"output_tokens":684,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":989,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":684,"cache_read_input_tokens":423475,"cache_creation_input_tokens":989,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":989},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ34cT28mR5cymENqjFs","type":"assistant","uuid":"d39d8219-3330-4998-bad7-04ef3e52c380","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:23:45.737Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
