{"parentUuid":"ee97bbd0-0c8e-4059-9a6f-633a02cbbf40","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ37jARfUS9QgB7TnPKS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017YixMyzxwGM6gKwoQsNQVq","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/STATUS.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1143,"cache_read_input_tokens":427543,"output_tokens":212,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1143,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":212,"cache_read_input_tokens":427543,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1143,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1143},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ37gct6F8DvHRhV5eZk","type":"assistant","uuid":"0b989d47-872f-4a7d-b1e5-79d60129b4b2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:24:24.139Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"0b989d47-872f-4a7d-b1e5-79d60129b4b2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2767ee7d-d768-4fc5-b864-ecc99fbdd4cb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017YixMyzxwGM6gKwoQsNQVq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Status\n2\t\n3\t**Updated:** 2026-07-22\n4\t\n5\tCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are\n6\ttested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode\n7\tare fully implemented — not stubs, despite what older docs in this repo used\n8\tto say. If you find another doc contradicting this file, this file wins.\n9\t\n10\t## Numbers\n11\t\n12\t- 191 Rust tests (21 cli + 158 core unit + 8 snapshot + 4 napi binding), 18\n13\t  vitest — all green\n14\t- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean\n15\t- 20 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`\n16\t  (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ariakit, ark-ui,\n17\t  base-ui, blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda,\n18\t  react-final-form, react-resizable-panels, storybook-emotion,\n19\t  tanstack-table, zendesk-garden — see `rdt-coverage.md`)\n20\t\n21\t## What's not built yet\n22\t\n23\t- **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`\n24\t  bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed.\n25\t- **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.\n26\t- **Barrel/re-export scoped-key allocation caching** — `resolver/chain.rs` /\n27\t  `named.rs` / `template.rs` build a `\"{file}:{name}\"` scoped-key string on\n28\t  every lookup. A `Borrow`-based type-map key would let lookups happen\n29\t  without allocating. Real but unbenchmarked — do as a focused perf pass if\n30\t  profiling shows it matters.\n31\t- **DTS cache has no dirty-flag or size cap** (`cache.rs`) — rewrites the\n32\t  whole cache file on every run regardless of whether anything changed, and\n33\t  has no upper bound on how large the on-disk cache can grow. Low severity\n34\t  (requires local write access, and an attacker with that already has better\n35\t  options) — worth fixing for large monorepos before it becomes a real cost.\n36\t\n37\t## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker\n38\t\n39\tSee the \"Known gaps summary\" table in `rdt-coverage.md` for the full,\n40\tmaintained list. The short version: conditional types, mapped types over an\n41\tunbound generic, and a couple of `@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes all\n42\tneed real type inference OXC deliberately doesn't do. Not bugs, not on the\n43\troadmap unless typescript-go's Corsa API stabilizes (see\n44\t`type-checker-integration.md`).\n45\t\n46\t## Where to look next\n47\t\n48\t- **What broke and why, historically** → `rdt-coverage.md` — every bug found\n49\t  during real-library validation, root cause, and the fix. Keep this updated;\n50\t  it's the project's memory.\n51\t- **Why a hard-to-reverse decision was made** → `docs/adr/` — OXC over the\n52\t  TypeScript compiler, manual serde for `PropType`, positional msgpack\n53\t  encoding, deferring type-checker integration. Write a new one when you make\n54\t  a decision like these (see `docs/adr/README.md`).\n55\t- **How the pipeline fits together** → `ARCHITECTURE.md`\n56\t- **Setup, testing, code style, commit conventions** → `CONTRIBUTING.md`\n57\t- **Migrating from react-docgen-typescript** → `MIGRATING.md`\n58\t- **Old build-out specs, resolved questions, point-in-time analyses** →\n59\t  `docs/archive/` — historical, not current, kept for reference\n60\t"}]},"uuid":"c405d891-e3e7-40b0-8d4f-c6ad2992ffb4","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:24:24.237Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/STATUS.md","content":"# Status\n\n**Updated:** 2026-07-22\n\nCore extraction, resolver, CLI, NAPI binding, and Vite plugin all work and are\ntested. Config file loading, cross-package `.d.ts` resolution, and watch mode\nare fully implemented — not stubs, despite what older docs in this repo used\nto say. If you find another doc contradicting this file, this file wins.\n\n## Numbers\n\n- 191 Rust tests (21 cli + 158 core unit + 8 snapshot + 4 napi binding), 18\n  vitest — all green\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings` clean\n- 20 real-world fixture libraries validated against `react-docgen-typescript`\n  (shadcn, Radix, MUI, Chakra, Mantine, React Aria, antd, ariakit, ark-ui,\n  base-ui, blueprint, day-picker, fluentui, headlessui, panda,\n  react-final-form, react-resizable-panels, storybook-emotion,\n  tanstack-table, zendesk-garden — see `rdt-coverage.md`)\n\n## What's not built yet\n\n- **Preset system** (`@oxc-react-docgen/presets`) — named `PipelineOptions`\n  bundles. Config-side only, no Rust changes needed.\n- **LSP server** — `lsp-types` is a dependency; nothing built on it.\n- **Barrel/re-export scoped-key allocation caching** — `resolver/chain.rs` /\n  `named.rs` / `template.rs` build a `\"{file}:{name}\"` scoped-key string on\n  every lookup. A `Borrow`-based type-map key would let lookups happen\n  without allocating. Real but unbenchmarked — do as a focused perf pass if\n  profiling shows it matters.\n- **DTS cache has no dirty-flag or size cap** (`cache.rs`) — rewrites the\n  whole cache file on every run regardless of whether anything changed, and\n  has no upper bound on how large the on-disk cache can grow. Low severity\n  (requires local write access, and an attacker with that already has better\n  options) — worth fixing for large monorepos before it becomes a real cost.\n\n## Known gaps that won't get fixed without a type checker\n\nSee the \"Known gaps summary\" table in `rdt-coverage.md` for the full,\nmaintained list. The short version: conditional types, mapped types over an\nunbound generic, and a couple of `@emotion/styled`-specific call shapes all\nneed real type inference OXC deliberately doesn't do. Not bugs, not on the\nroadmap unless typescript-go's Corsa API stabilizes (see\n`type-checker-integration.md`).\n\n## Where to look next\n\n- **What broke and why, historically** → `rdt-coverage.md` — every bug found\n  during real-library validation, root cause, and the fix. Keep this updated;\n  it's the project's memory.\n- **Why a hard-to-reverse decision was made** → `docs/adr/` — OXC over the\n  TypeScript compiler, manual serde for `PropType`, positional msgpack\n  encoding, deferring type-checker integration. Write a new one when you make\n  a decision like these (see `docs/adr/README.md`).\n- **How the pipeline fits together** → `ARCHITECTURE.md`\n- **Setup, testing, code style, commit conventions** → `CONTRIBUTING.md`\n- **Migrating from react-docgen-typescript** → `MIGRATING.md`\n- **Old build-out specs, resolved questions, point-in-time analyses** →\n  `docs/archive/` — historical, not current, kept for reference\n","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":60}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0b989d47-872f-4a7d-b1e5-79d60129b4b2","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
