{"parentUuid":"378c0a93-0854-4b40-841b-7bad1ff8c9ab","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2767ee7d-d768-4fc5-b864-ecc99fbdd4cb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AXY57yk4NSDAq1ejsRufoV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Archive\n2\t\n3\tHistorical record, not documentation. Nothing here reflects current state —\n4\tcheck `docs/STATUS.md` and `docs/rdt-coverage.md` for that instead.\n5\t\n6\t- `00-MASTER-PLAN.md` through `07-AGENT-DISPATCH.md` — the original agent work\n7\t  orders used to bootstrap this repo (Phases 0-5b). All complete.\n8\t- `08-OPEN-QUESTIONS.md` — pre-implementation design questions. Resolved.\n9\t- `10-QUALITY-AND-ARCHITECTURE.md` — the resolver/extractor module-split\n10\t  refactor plan. Done; see `ARCHITECTURE.md` for the resulting layout.\n11\t- `10-PLUGIN-SPEC.md` — the Vite plugin spec. Shipped; see README.md.\n12\t- `adversarial-analysis-2026-06-28.md` — a point-in-time validation pass.\n13\t  Findings folded into `docs/rdt-coverage.md`.\n14\t- `2026-06-16-phase-5a-vite-plugin.md` — the Vite plugin implementation plan\n15\t  (follows on from `10-PLUGIN-SPEC.md`). Shipped; see `packages/vite-plugin`.\n16\t- `2026-06-25-phase6-integration-tests.md` — wiring `moon run validate:compare`\n17\t  for `apps/validate`. Shipped; see `docs/rdt-coverage.md` for how it's used.\n18\t- `2026-06-28-structural-gap-fixes.md` — five resolver gaps found during RDT\n19\t  compatibility auditing (method-sig params, React namespace types, `Readonly`,\n20\t  inline `Pick`/`Omit`). All fixed.\n21\t- `2026-07-07-adversarial-analysis-fixes.md` — an eight-task wave from a\n22\t  five-domain (perf/Rust-best-practices/security/UX-DX/output-correctness)\n23\t  adversarial analysis. All eight landed. Two items it explicitly deferred\n24\t  (scoped-key allocation caching, `cache.rs` dirty-flag/size-cap) are folded\n25\t  into `docs/STATUS.md`'s \"What's not built yet\" section so they aren't lost.\n26\t"}]},"uuid":"385f759c-ef79-4e6a-8658-6ebc2a0ae2cf","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:24:41.415Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/archive/README.md","content":"# Archive\n\nHistorical record, not documentation. Nothing here reflects current state —\ncheck `docs/STATUS.md` and `docs/rdt-coverage.md` for that instead.\n\n- `00-MASTER-PLAN.md` through `07-AGENT-DISPATCH.md` — the original agent work\n  orders used to bootstrap this repo (Phases 0-5b). All complete.\n- `08-OPEN-QUESTIONS.md` — pre-implementation design questions. Resolved.\n- `10-QUALITY-AND-ARCHITECTURE.md` — the resolver/extractor module-split\n  refactor plan. Done; see `ARCHITECTURE.md` for the resulting layout.\n- `10-PLUGIN-SPEC.md` — the Vite plugin spec. Shipped; see README.md.\n- `adversarial-analysis-2026-06-28.md` — a point-in-time validation pass.\n  Findings folded into `docs/rdt-coverage.md`.\n- `2026-06-16-phase-5a-vite-plugin.md` — the Vite plugin implementation plan\n  (follows on from `10-PLUGIN-SPEC.md`). Shipped; see `packages/vite-plugin`.\n- `2026-06-25-phase6-integration-tests.md` — wiring `moon run validate:compare`\n  for `apps/validate`. Shipped; see `docs/rdt-coverage.md` for how it's used.\n- `2026-06-28-structural-gap-fixes.md` — five resolver gaps found during RDT\n  compatibility auditing (method-sig params, React namespace types, `Readonly`,\n  inline `Pick`/`Omit`). All fixed.\n- `2026-07-07-adversarial-analysis-fixes.md` — an eight-task wave from a\n  five-domain (perf/Rust-best-practices/security/UX-DX/output-correctness)\n  adversarial analysis. All eight landed. Two items it explicitly deferred\n  (scoped-key allocation caching, `cache.rs` dirty-flag/size-cap) are folded\n  into `docs/STATUS.md`'s \"What's not built yet\" section so they aren't lost.\n","numLines":26,"startLine":1,"totalLines":26}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"378c0a93-0854-4b40-841b-7bad1ff8c9ab","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypo