{"parentUuid":"5ca2164a-43a9-443d-bf46-036f05f7da4a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2767ee7d-d768-4fc5-b864-ecc99fbdd4cb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S4mEgvZmCMXP8zrK8WgVe6","type":"tool_result","content":"=== CLAUDE.md (root) ===\nhead: illegal line count -- 0\n\n# oxc-react-docgen\n\n10-100x faster drop-in replacement for react-docgen-typescript. OXC parses TypeScript/TSX; we extract React component props and emit RDT-compatible JSON. See `docs/STATUS.md` for current state and known gaps.\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\ncargo test -p oxc-react-docgen-core          # unit + snapshot tests\ncargo clippy -p oxc-react-docgen-core -- -D warnings\ncargo build --release                         # full build including CLI\n```\n\nOr use `/check` and `/snapshot` for the common workflows.\n\n=== ARCHITECTURE.md sample ===\n# Architecture\n\n## Pipeline\n\nEvery extraction — cold or incremental — flows through four phases:\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    src[\"Source files\\n.ts / .tsx / .d.ts\"]\n    oxc[\"OXC parser\\none allocator per file\"]\n    sd[\"SourceData\\ninterfaces, type aliases,\\nimport bindings, defaults\"]\n    gsd[\"GlobalSourceData\\nmerged across all files\\nArc&lt;ArcSwap&lt;…&gt;&gt;\"]\n    ce[\"ComponentEntry\\nresolved props,\\ninheritance chain\"]\n    out[\"ExtractionOutput\\nJSON-serializable\"]\n\n    src -->|\"discover_files()\\nignore crate\"| oxc\n    oxc -->|\"parse_file()\\nper-file parallel\"| sd\n    sd -->|\"rayon par_iter\\nmerge()\"| gsd\n    gsd -->|\"resolve_component()\\nper-component parallel\"| ce\n    ce -->|\"pipeline::extract()\"| out","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"94c88156-f58f-4fe1-81af-9e237a7bcc1f","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:25:27.600Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== CLAUDE.md (root) ===\nhead: illegal line count -- 0\n\n# oxc-react-docgen\n\n10-100x faster drop-in replacement for react-docgen-typescript. OXC parses TypeScript/TSX; we extract React component props and emit RDT-compatible JSON. See `docs/STATUS.md` for current state and known gaps.\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\ncargo test -p oxc-react-docgen-core          # unit + snapshot tests\ncargo clippy -p oxc-react-docgen-core -- -D warnings\ncargo build --release                         # full build including CLI\n```\n\nOr use `/check` and `/snapshot` for the common workflows.\n\n=== ARCHITECTURE.md sample ===\n# Architecture\n\n## Pipeline\n\nEvery extraction — cold or incremental — flows through four phases:\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    src[\"Source files\\n.ts / .tsx / .d.ts\"]\n    oxc[\"OXC parser\\none allocator per file\"]\n    sd[\"SourceData\\ninterfaces, type aliases,\\nimport bindings, defaults\"]\n    gsd[\"GlobalSourceData\\nmerged across all files\\nArc&lt;ArcSwap&lt;…&gt;&gt;\"]\n    ce[\"ComponentEntry\\nresolved props,\\ninheritance chain\"]\n    out[\"ExtractionOutput\\nJSON-serializable\"]\n\n    src -->|\"discover_files()\\nignore crate\"| oxc\n    oxc -->|\"parse_file()\\nper-file parallel\"| sd\n    sd -->|\"rayon par_iter\\nmerge()\"| gsd\n    gsd -->|\"resolve_component()\\nper-component parallel\"| ce\n    ce -->|\"pipeline::extract()\"| out","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5ca2164a-43a9-443d-bf46-036f05f7da4a","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
