{"parentUuid":"431eee6f-007b-40ff-a6ff-a1ecfb5442ed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ3LZsC5rDFWwYNxVsLG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EFMSpDb8kyGNbsfdqjyvWa","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n '180,190p' ARCHITECTURE.md\necho \"---README---\"\nsed -n '60,92p' README.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11858,"cache_read_input_tokens":452725,"output_tokens":1080,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11858,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1080,"cache_read_input_tokens":452725,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11858,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11858},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ3LUsZHBw4Euc1vKCFt","type":"assistant","uuid":"c3d55eb8-9533-4d13-a5c8-a851a9d62cf0","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:27:28.533Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"c3d55eb8-9533-4d13-a5c8-a851a9d62cf0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2767ee7d-d768-4fc5-b864-ecc99fbdd4cb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EFMSpDb8kyGNbsfdqjyvWa","type":"tool_result","content":"| Conditional types (`T extends U ? X : Y`) | Emitted as `opaque` — needs a real type checker, see `docs/type-checker-integration.md`. |\n| Mapped types with computed keys | Emitted as `opaque`. |\n\nConfig file loading and cross-package `.d.ts` resolution are both fully\nimplemented — see `docs/STATUS.md` if you're checking whether an older doc's\nclaim about either is still true.\n---README---\n## CLI\n\nThe CLI is a single Rust binary (`crates/cli`) — argument parsing, output formatting, and\n`--format rdt`/`--format storybook` serialization all live there and nowhere else.\n`@oxc-react-docgen/cli` (once published) is a thin npm wrapper that just execs the\nplatform-appropriate compiled binary; it deliberately contains no reimplementation of CLI\nbehavior, so there's exactly one place that behavior can drift.\n\n```bash\n# Once published: npx @oxc-react-docgen/cli extract --src src/ --out docgen.json\n# From source today: ./target/release/oxc-react-docgen (after cargo build --release)\n\n# One-shot extraction\noxc-react-docgen extract --src src/ --out docgen.json\n\n# Inspect a single file\noxc-react-docgen inspect src/components/Button.tsx\n\n# Watch mode\noxc-react-docgen watch --src src/\n\n# Shell completions\noxc-react-docgen completions zsh > ~/.zsh/completions/_oxc-react-docgen\n\n# Full HTML attribute expansion instead of the default curated subset\noxc-react-docgen extract --src src/ --html-attributes full\n```\n\nSettings can also live in `docgen.config.ts` (`srcDirs`, `htmlAttributes`, `reactVersion`, `crossPackage`, and\nmore — see `crates/cli/src/config.rs` for the full schema) instead of CLI flags.\n\n## Output shape","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f9a4e871-a941-4a24-9e98-65c78e7d1e78","timestamp":"2026-07-23T00:27:28.665Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"| Conditional types (`T extends U ? X : Y`) | Emitted as `opaque` — needs a real type checker, see `docs/type-checker-integration.md`. |\n| Mapped types with computed keys | Emitted as `opaque`. |\n\nConfig file loading and cross-package `.d.ts` resolution are both fully\nimplemented — see `docs/STATUS.md` if you're checking whether an older doc's\nclaim about either is still true.\n---README---\n## CLI\n\nThe CLI is a single Rust binary (`crates/cli`) — argument parsing, output formatting, and\n`--format rdt`/`--format storybook` serialization all live there and nowhere else.\n`@oxc-react-docgen/cli` (once published) is a thin npm wrapper that just execs the\nplatform-appropriate compiled binary; it deliberately contains no reimplementation of CLI\nbehavior, so there's exactly one place that behavior can drift.\n\n```bash\n# Once published: npx @oxc-react-docgen/cli extract --src src/ --out docgen.json\n# From source today: ./target/release/oxc-react-docgen (after cargo build --release)\n\n# One-shot extraction\noxc-react-docgen extract --src src/ --out docgen.json\n\n# Inspect a single file\noxc-react-docgen inspect src/components/Button.tsx\n\n# Watch mode\noxc-react-docgen watch --src src/\n\n# Shell completions\noxc-react-docgen completions zsh > ~/.zsh/completions/_oxc-react-docgen\n\n# Full HTML attribute expansion instead of the default curated subset\noxc-react-docgen extract --src src/ --html-attributes full\n```\n\nSettings can also live in `docgen.config.ts` (`srcDirs`, `htmlAttributes`, `reactVersion`, `crossPackage`, and\nmore — see `crates/cli/src/config.rs` for the full schema) instead of CLI flags.\n\n## Output shape","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c3d55eb8-9533-4d13-a5c8-a851a9d62cf0","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
