{"parentUuid":"947e2efb-0fe2-4672-9ecf-3846ad48c79f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ5tV3biMwoFA4NoE3cG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd hold off on both. A GH Project board earns its keep when multiple people need shared visibility into what's in-flight — right now that's just this session's TodoWrite, and a kanban board tracking the same two items (presets, LSP server) is overhead with no audience. Milestones tie to a release train, and there's no published version yet to hang one on (repo isn't on npm).\n\nWhat I'd actually do: open the two \"What's not built yet\" items as real GH Issues now (cheap, and gives external visibility on a public repo), then revisit Projects/Milestones once one of two things happens — a real release ships and needs a version to track against, or the roadmap grows past a small handful of items where a flat issue list stops being enough. Want me to open those two issues now?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":65,"cache_read_input_tokens":517506,"output_tokens":1040,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":65,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1040,"cache_read_input_tokens":517506,"cache_creation_input_tokens":65,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":65},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ5tMHms7yboPUcTcJFU","type":"assistant","uuid":"60bcbef4-b53b-4dd3-8963-37bcefdf8bb5","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:01:02.117Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7