{"parentUuid":"6b47908f-d804-4599-9596-ba0df144df81","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ63A84WdUwNdr7NMCQ5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2507,"cache_read_input_tokens":527192,"output_tokens":1550,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2507,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1550,"cache_read_input_tokens":527192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2507,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2507},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ633pJNHJsEWR7veGtK","type":"assistant","uuid":"3e76d9a7-30db-4ae8-b332-5e23d0d77542","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:02:47.606Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"3e76d9a7-30db-4ae8-b332-5e23d0d77542","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ63A84WdUwNdr7NMCQ5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Full picture now. Status per tool:\n\n**Set up well:**\n- **pnpm** — pinned (`packageManager: \"pnpm@10\"`, proto pins the same major), workspace globs correct, CI has a real matrix (Node 24/26) plus a dedicated job that verifies the napi binary resolves as a transitive dep for both npm and pnpm consumers.\n- **just** — comprehensive `justfile` (install, build, test, test-ts, bench, coverage, lint, fmt, deny, typos, ci, compare, clean, setup, plus moon/cargo passthroughs).\n- **clippy** — enforced in three places consistently: `justfile`'s `lint`, moon's git pre-commit hook, and CI's `lint` job, all with `-D warnings`.\n- **vitest** — well set up for `vite-plugin` (18 tests, clean mocking of the napi boundary), and CI actually runs it across a Node matrix.\n- **Coverage** — real: `cargo llvm-cov` → lcov → uploaded to Codecov in CI. Rust-only though, and there's no badge in the README, so it's invisible unless you go looking.\n\n**Deliberate substitutes, not gaps:**\n- **mise** — not used; `proto` (moonrepo's toolchain manager) does this job instead, pinning node/pnpm/rust/moon in `.prototools`. Makes sense since `moon` is already the task runner — mise would be a second, competing tool doing the same thing.\n\n**Real gaps:**\n- **oxlint** — not set up at all. Zero TS/JS linting exists anywhere in the repo (no eslint either). `just lint` and CI's `lint` job are Rust-only. Given the whole project is built on OXC, this is the most natural gap to close.\n- **oxcfmt** — not set up, and there's a live bug hiding behind it: `just fmt` calls `pnpm exec prettier --write .`, but prettier isn't a devDependency anywhere in `package.json` or `pnpm-lock.yaml`. That command likely fails or silently does something unpinned today.\n- **tsdown** — not used; `vite-plugin`'s build is bare `tsc` (type-check + unbundled ESM emit, no bundler at all). Fine if nothing needs single-file distribution, but worth naming.\n- **Test-result publishing** — coverage uploads, but there's no JUnit/annotation output from `cargo nextest`, so failures don't show up as PR check annotations, just log output.\n- **Dependency updates** — no dependabot or renovate config anywhere.\n- **`release.yml`** — exists but is explicitly marked \"UNTESTED SCAFFOLDING\" by whoever wrote it (transparent, but means it's not real yet).\n\nWant me to close the concrete ones — pin/fix prettier (or swap for oxlint's formatter once I check its current maturity), and add oxlint for the TS/JS side?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2507,"cache_read_input_tokens":527192,"output_tokens":1550,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2507,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1550,"cache_read_input_tokens":527192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2507,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2507},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ633pJNHJsEWR7veGtK","type":"assistant","uuid":"26996a02-fab2-4174-a3db-a362e0c519be","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:02:57.789Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
