{"parentUuid":"9ca63c49-93d2-4eda-b11e-b07f6e5b51e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ6S556Rg7E4bgnNG6pR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2300,"cache_read_input_tokens":531323,"output_tokens":2075,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2300,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2075,"cache_read_input_tokens":531323,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2300,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2300},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ6S2DCURYrBhKEu4HgZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"67a8aef7-7f31-4420-8de6-7cc3e9930eae","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:08:07.471Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"67a8aef7-7f31-4420-8de6-7cc3e9930eae","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ6S556Rg7E4bgnNG6pR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Quick correction first: this actually is a monorepo by the usual definition — `crates/core`, `crates/cli`, `crates/binding`, `packages/napi`, `packages/vite-plugin`, `apps/validate` are six independently-buildable projects across two languages, and `apps/validate` genuinely depends on `cli:build` finishing first (moon models that dependency). But the real question is whether moon's *machinery* (task graphs, caching, VCS hook sync) is worth it at this size — and looking at actual usage, it's lighter than I expected: **CI never calls moon at all** (`ci.yml`/`release.yml` use plain `cargo`/`pnpm` throughout). moon's only real load-bearing jobs are:\n\n1. `apps/validate`'s `compare` task ordering (build the CLI before running the comparison)\n2. `moon sync vcs-hooks` installing the git pre-commit hook\n3. `justfile`'s `build`/`clean` recipes, and three redundant `package.json` scripts that just re-delegate to moon\n\nSo dropping it is a smaller change than it looks — mostly replacing (1) and (2) with something explicit in the `justfile`.\n\nPlan I'd run with:\n- **proto → mise**: translate `.prototools` (node ~26, pnpm ~10, rust 1.96.0) into `.mise.toml`, drop moon from the pinned tools, update `CONTRIBUTING.md`'s setup instructions.\n- **Drop moon entirely**: remove `.moon/`, the six `moon.yml` files, and moon from `package.json`'s scripts.\n- **`apps/validate`'s build-before-compare ordering** → a `just compare` recipe that runs `cargo build --release -p oxc-react-docgen` then the compare script directly, no task-graph tool needed for a two-step chain.\n- **VCS hooks** → a plain `.git-hooks/pre-commit` script (or a `just install-hooks` that symlinks it) running the same `cargo fmt --check && cargo clippy ...` moon currently wires up, since that's genuinely simple enough not to need a tool for.\n\nSound right, or did you want mise to also take over the git-hook piece (mise has its own hook support) instead of a plain script?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2300,"cache_read_input_tokens":531323,"output_tokens":2075,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2300,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2075,"cache_read_input_tokens":531323,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2300,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2300},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ6S2DCURYrBhKEu4HgZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"c688b956-a2bf-401e-bc16-f11389408068","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:08:15.826Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
