{"parentUuid":"7e812e9e-843f-4ecc-9afc-a3509bb124db","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ6VCtinrbVM6qYmUpEn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DafrjXh1AdeKvD6tnBWkjf","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"oxfmt oxc formatter stable release 2026 npm"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2452,"cache_read_input_tokens":535775,"output_tokens":416,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2452,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":416,"cache_read_input_tokens":535775,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2452,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2452},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ6V5XiSeryDmkhU9Lf2","type":"assistant","uuid":"9d884833-b2a4-474f-b1ec-d82d8d14df11","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:08:38.478Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"9d884833-b2a4-474f-b1ec-d82d8d14df11","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2cee45ef-56ee-490d-85af-85d762605c8b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DafrjXh1AdeKvD6tnBWkjf","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"oxfmt oxc formatter stable release 2026 npm\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Oxfmt Beta\",\"url\":\"https://peerlist.io/saxenashikhil/articles/oxfmt-beta\"},{\"title\":\"oxfmt - npm\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/oxfmt\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · oxc-project/oxc\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc/releases\"},{\"title\":\"Oxc Release Notes - July 2026 Latest Updates - Releasebot\",\"url\":\"https://releasebot.io/updates/oxc\"},{\"title\":\"Oxfmt Beta\",\"url\":\"https://oxc.rs/blog/2026-02-24-oxfmt-beta\"},{\"title\":\"@oxfmt/binding-linux-x64-gnu - npm\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@oxfmt/binding-linux-x64-gnu\"},{\"title\":\"oxfmt CLI | oxc-project/oxc | DeepWiki\",\"url\":\"https://deepwiki.com/oxc-project/oxc/10.2-oxfmt-cli\"},{\"title\":\"Ox (programming language)\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ox_(programming_language)\"},{\"title\":\"Oxfmt\",\"url\":\"https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/formatter.html\"},{\"title\":\"oxfmt - npmx\",\"url\":\"https://npmx.dev/package/oxfmt\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about oxfmt:\n\n## Oxfmt Overview\n\nOxfmt is a Rust-powered, Prettier-compatible code formatter built for the JavaScript ecosystem. In benchmarks, Oxfmt is more than 30× faster than Prettier and 3× faster than Biome on an initial run without caching.\n\n## Current Status\n\nThe latest version is 0.59.0, last published 6 days ago. (as of July 2026) While the search results show active development and recent releases, I did not find evidence of a full stable 1.0 release in 2026. A beta release was announced on March 12, 2026.\n\n## Features\n\nSince the December alpha release, support has been expanded for additional file formats, embedded language formatting, import sorting has been introduced, Tailwind CSS support has been integrated, and numerous stability and compatibility improvements have been delivered.\n\n## NPM Installation\n\nYou can start using oxfmt in your project by running `npm i oxfmt`. There are 129 other projects in the npm registry using oxfmt.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"4753fe54-5f3c-44b7-b872-50a5bfe67ecd","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:08:45.778Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"oxfmt oxc formatter stable release 2026 npm","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01FeJ4y5VgHtZcCynQs5LNqL","content":[{"title":"Oxfmt Beta","url":"https://peerlist.io/saxenashikhil/articles/oxfmt-beta"},{"title":"oxfmt - npm","url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/oxfmt"},{"title":"Releases · oxc-project/oxc","url":"https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc/releases"},{"title":"Oxc Release Notes - July 2026 Latest Updates - Releasebot","url":"https://releasebot.io/updates/oxc"},{"title":"Oxfmt Beta","url":"https://oxc.rs/blog/2026-02-24-oxfmt-beta"},{"title":"@oxfmt/binding-linux-x64-gnu - npm","url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@oxfmt/binding-linux-x64-gnu"},{"title":"oxfmt CLI | oxc-project/oxc | DeepWiki","url":"https://deepwiki.com/oxc-project/oxc/10.2-oxfmt-cli"},{"title":"Ox (programming language)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ox_(programming_language)"},{"title":"Oxfmt","url":"https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/formatter.html"},{"title":"oxfmt - npmx","url":"https://npmx.dev/package/oxfmt"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about oxfmt:\n\n## Oxfmt Overview\n\nOxfmt is a Rust-powered, Prettier-compatible code formatter built for the JavaScript ecosystem. In benchmarks, Oxfmt is more than 30× faster than Prettier and 3× faster than Biome on an initial run without caching.\n\n## Current Status\n\nThe latest version is 0.59.0, last published 6 days ago. (as of July 2026) While the search results show active development and recent releases, I did not find evidence of a full stable 1.0 release in 2026. A beta release was announced on March 12, 2026.\n\n## Features\n\nSince the December alpha release, support has been expanded for additional file formats, embedded language formatting, import sorting has been introduced, Tailwind CSS support has been integrated, and numerous stability and compatibility improvements have been delivered.\n\n## NPM Installation\n\nYou can start using oxfmt in your project by running `npm i oxfmt`. There are 129 other projects in the npm registry using oxfmt."],"durationSeconds":7.237408875003457,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9d884833-b2a4-474f-b1ec-d82d8d14df11","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
