{"parentUuid":"d156903a-b7d8-4e8c-943f-62f17afe04ca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ6XeTvPBeXbLqYKnAyD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1617,"cache_read_input_tokens":539583,"output_tokens":1479,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1617,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1479,"cache_read_input_tokens":539583,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1617,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1617},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ6Xbnw57ngf5zkDKHtr","type":"assistant","uuid":"ae4a8f2c-bf88-4564-9be4-949af52d6923","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:09:20.922Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"ae4a8f2c-bf88-4564-9be4-949af52d6923","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ6XeTvPBeXbLqYKnAyD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Being a monorepo doesn't automatically mean you need moon — it means you need *something* to order the one real cross-project dependency (`validate` waiting on `cli` to build) and run tasks across two languages, and a monorepo this size (6 projects, one real inter-dependency) doesn't obviously need moon's specific value-add (remote caching, affected-only builds, complex task graphs) to get that. The fact that CI never touches moon today is a pretty strong signal it isn't earning its keep here.\n\nMy actual recommendation: mise yes, moon no. mise is the better toolchain pin regardless of monorepo-ness (broader ecosystem, not tied to moon), and a `justfile` can handle the one ordering dependency directly (`cargo build --release -p oxc-react-docgen && ./target/release/... compare`) without a task-graph tool. If the project later grows to where build times or cross-package caching actually hurt, moon's a reasonable thing to reach for then — but adopting it now for a monorepo this size is optimizing for a scale you're not at.\n\nWant me to proceed with that (mise + justfile, no moon), or would you rather keep moon since it's already working and the migration cost isn't worth it?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1617,"cache_read_input_tokens":539583,"output_tokens":1479,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1617,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1479,"cache_read_input_tokens":539583,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1617,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1617},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ6Xbnw57ngf5zkDKHtr","type":"assistant","uuid":"05860b3d-1f35-41d7-84a8-f194d2a57031","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:09:26.056Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
