{"parentUuid":"534faf6d-1d1f-4bca-96d7-72dd896779e0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ711iMX2frbbYXrme7i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2646,"cache_read_input_tokens":547663,"output_tokens":2524,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2646,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2524,"cache_read_input_tokens":547663,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2646,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2646},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ6zvcX5KHaPd6618k3N","type":"assistant","uuid":"e3acdbe9-96b4-44a8-b350-453c8ba2c0dd","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:15:34.674Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"e3acdbe9-96b4-44a8-b350-453c8ba2c0dd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdJ711iMX2frbbYXrme7i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Just + moon:** yes, genuinely — but not by flipping a switch, because the current setup doesn't actually route through either consistently. What I just found in the actual `moon.yml` files:\n\n- `crates/core/moon.yml` and `crates/binding/moon.yml` are **empty** — zero tasks defined.\n- No project defines a `test` or `lint` task anywhere except `vite-plugin`. So `package.json`'s `\"test\": \"moon run :test\"` and `\"lint\": \"moon run :lint\"` scripts don't resolve to anything for most of the workspace — they're broken today, not simplified.\n- `packages/napi/moon.yml`'s `build` task runs plain `cargo build -p oxc-react-docgen-napi` — but the real, correct build command (per your own README) is `napi build --platform --release`. The moon task is wrong, which is presumably why nothing actually depends on it.\n- CI doesn't call `just` or `moon` at all — it hand-writes the same `cargo clippy --workspace --exclude oxc-react-docgen-napi --locked -- -D warnings` a third time, independently of `justfile`'s `lint` recipe and moon's pre-commit hook.\n\nSo right now there are three independent copies of the same logic that can silently drift, not one simplified pipeline. Real simplification: fix the task definitions per project (real build commands, add `test`/`lint` tasks everywhere), make `justfile` recipes call `moon run` instead of raw `cargo`/`pnpm`, and point CI at the same `moon run`/`moon ci` commands. One source of truth, `just` as the friendly surface, moon as the actual graph. Want me to do that pass?\n\n**Changesets:** no `.changeset` exists yet — clean slate. Scope it to the three real npm packages (`@oxc-react-docgen/napi`, `@oxc-react-docgen/vite-plugin`, `@oxc-react-docgen/cli`), not the Rust crates (nothing's published to crates.io, so there's no independent-versioning problem to solve there — the workspace version can keep moving in lockstep manually).\n\nProposed flow:\n1. `pnpm add -Dw @changesets/cli && pnpm changeset init`, exclude `apps/validate` (private, never published) via `.changeset/config.json`'s `ignore`.\n2. Contributors run `pnpm changeset` on a PR touching a package — records intent + a changelog blurb, checked into the PR.\n3. `changesets/action` in CI opens/maintains a standing \"Version Packages\" PR; merging it bumps versions and writes CHANGELOGs.\n4. That merge is the trigger for the currently-untested `release.yml` — replace its manual `workflow_dispatch` with \"runs after a Version Packages merge,\" so the 5-platform build matrix and npm publish become the automated tail end of the same flow instead of a separate manual step someone has to remember.\n5. One detail that needs explicit handling: `packages/napi`'s per-platform optional dependencies (`napi-darwin-arm64` etc.) must always match the root package's version exactly — changesets' \"linked packages\" config (or a small postversion sync script) needs to keep those pinned together, not versioned independently.\n\nWant me to scaffold `.changeset/config.json` and wire step 4 into `release.yml`, or hold off until the moon/CI cleanup lands first so you're not stacking two infra changes at once?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2646,"cache_read_input_tokens":547663,"output_tokens":2524,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2646,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2524,"cache_read_input_tokens":547663,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2646,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2646},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJ6zvcX5KHaPd6618k3N","type":"assistant","uuid":"855d331f-a059-4ed3-b3f2-9ecceea7b7c7","timestamp":"2026-07-23T01:15:45.705Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
