{"parentUuid":"de0c2e81-c64d-4225-b5f1-b160a0923f23","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdKEy4RCwECs8vRR9En2Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_read_input_tokens":571477,"output_tokens":2122,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2122,"cache_read_input_tokens":571477,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdKExxspx7yYfVaG8cABw","type":"assistant","uuid":"790a7c08-fdb2-46ae-8ad3-66b06df85ad0","timestamp":"2026-07-23T15:40:41.350Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"790a7c08-fdb2-46ae-8ad3-66b06df85ad0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdKEy4RCwECs8vRR9En2Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"History itself is clean — no secrets found across all 114 commits (the hits are false positives: a fixture type named `API_KeyCollection`, and legitimate `${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}` references in CI, never an actual leaked value). But two real things turned up that need your call before anything gets pushed:\n\n1. **License conflict.** The new repo's \"Initial commit\" includes a real **GNU AGPLv3** `LICENSE` file — but this project has no `LICENSE` file locally, and every `package.json`/`Cargo.toml` claims `\"license\": \"MIT\"`. AGPLv3 and MIT are very different (AGPL's network-use copyleft clause in particular). This needs an explicit decision, not a silent pick — which one do you actually want?\n\n2. **`.gitignore` divergence.** The remote's is more complete for the JS/TS side (`.env`, IDE files, `coverage/`, log files) than the local Rust-focused one. Worth merging both rather than one clobbering the other.\n\nSmaller, optional item: commits are attributed across three different emails (`gabe@techworx.dev`, `gabe@cura-castro.com`, and the remote's initial commit under `gcastro@technicalworx.com`). Rewriting all 114 commits to one identity is possible and safe *only* because nothing's pushed here yet — but it's a real history rewrite (new SHAs for everything), so I'd only do it if you actually want consistent authorship, not by default.\n\nMechanically: local and remote don't share history (unrelated-histories case, not a fast-forward), so landing this will need a force-push once the license/gitignore questions are settled — that's a destructive remote operation I won't do without you saying so explicitly.\n\nWhat's the actual intended license?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_read_input_tokens":571477,"output_tokens":2122,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2122,"cache_read_input_tokens":571477,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdKExxspx7yYfVaG8cABw","type":"assistant","uuid":"1a96328a-b698-4dae-b606-7fc9df6d6ed8","timestamp":"2026-07-23T15:40:47.371Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
