{"parentUuid":"991a6052-9158-4cf1-a98d-de97f0d6f4b8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdKHhvdL3E9pefv6gJrFp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Quite a few threads are open from this session. Here's where things stand:\n\n**Ready for me to execute, just need a go-ahead:**\n1. **Prettier → oxfmt/oxlint/clippy** — you confirmed the direction and gave config guidance (120-char width, pedantic oxlint for source, relaxed for tests) but I got pulled into verifying oxfmt's maturity (confirmed: beta, v0.59.0, actively used — real enough to adopt) and never actually wired it in. This is the biggest unstarted item.\n2. **moon.yml gaps** — found real bugs while investigating: `crates/core` and `crates/binding` have empty `moon.yml` (no tasks at all), `packages/napi`'s build task runs the wrong command (`cargo build` instead of `napi build --platform --release`), and no project defines `test`/`lint` tasks anywhere except vite-plugin — so `package.json`'s `moon run :test`/`:lint` scripts are currently broken. Proposed fixing these plus wiring `moon ci`'s affected-detection into the GitHub workflow.\n3. **Changesets** — proposed a concrete plan (scope to the 3 npm packages, `changesets/action` PR flow, tie into the untested `release.yml`). Said I'd hold off until the moon/CI cleanup lands first, unless you want it sooner.\n4. **Two GitHub Issues** for the \"not built yet\" roadmap items (preset system, LSP server).\n\n**Waiting on your decision:**\n5. **Push to the new remote** — local (119 commits) and `orin-dx/oxc-react-docgen` (1 commit) have unrelated histories; landing this needs a force-push, which I won't do without explicit confirmation.\n6. **Author-email normalization** — 3 different emails across history. Rewriting is only safe pre-push (fine right now), but it's your call whether it's worth doing.\n\nIf I had to sequence it myself: fix the moon.yml gaps first (they're real bugs independent of everything else), then oxfmt/oxlint, then changesets (since it wants a clean CI to hang off of), then push once you've decided on the author-email question — issues can happen anytime, they're independent. Want me to just start down that list, or reorder it?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":107,"cache_read_input_tokens":594732,"output_tokens":1948,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":107,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1948,"cache_read_input_tokens":594732,"cache_creation_input_tokens":107,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":107},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdKHhoUxXKmAf5P6pNvTt","type":"assistant","uuid":"d11cb9d4-b386-4456-9f5b-c45b302c9500","timestamp":"2026-07-23T16:16:40.573Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
