{"parentUuid":"bf1a3af8-c0ab-4495-a5f0-23b6e44eb7b3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Read","toolUseID":"toolu_01XS7o47CRXwjZqxkxELuCzL","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"terminalSequence\":\"\\u001b]777;notify;warp://cli-agent;{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"agent\\\":\\\"claude\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"tool_complete\\\",\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"oxc-react-codegen\\\",\\\"tool_name\\\":\\\"Read\\\"}\\u0007\"}\n","stderr":"/Users/gabe/.claude/plugins/cache/claude-code-warp/warp/2.1.0/scripts/emit-terminal-sequence.sh: line 82: /dev/tty: Device not configured\n","exitCode":0,"command":"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/on-post-tool-use.sh","durationMs":76},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b1624e32-9dd5-43ab-845c-76a20e22865a","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:01:52.829Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"b1624e32-9dd5-43ab-845c-76a20e22865a","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"nested_memory","path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/crates/cli/CLAUDE.md","content":{"path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/crates/cli/CLAUDE.md","type":"Project","content":"\n# crates/cli\n\nThin command layer — no extraction logic. Each command parses args and delegates to `oxc-react-docgen-core::pipeline`.\n\n## Layout\n\n```\nmain.rs              — Cli struct, Command enum, *Args structs, main(), init_tracing()\ncommands/            — one file per subcommand (extract, watch, inspect, check, completions)\nconfig.rs            — docgen.config.ts loading, maps to PipelineOptions\noutput.rs            — comfy-table formatting helpers\n```\n\n## Rules\n\nAll user-facing output goes through `output.rs` or the tracing subscriber — never `println!` in command handlers. Error display uses `miette`. Progress uses `indicatif`.\n\nConfig loading (`config.rs`) runs the user's `docgen.config.ts` via node+tsx. The config file path is passed via env var, not embedded in a shell string — command injection risk otherwise.\n","contentDiffersFromDisk":false},"displayPath":"crates/cli/CLAUDE.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"af20808e-5e08-43d2-8591-2dec07944189","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:01:52.990Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
