{"parentUuid":"5193b7be-7e0d-4339-af12-6ad8d348db0b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Explanatory"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"572afc43-fba6-40c2-80ee-26a1b699b61b","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:05:11.297Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"572afc43-fba6-40c2-80ee-26a1b699b61b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdMe88rnVFjS89pPky1ex","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JdRYaQWSPnLN9RwRGiKSLv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(moon): fill in missing task definitions, fix napi's wrong build command\n\ncrates/core and crates/binding had empty moon.yml — no tasks at all.\nNo project defined test/lint tasks anywhere except vite-plugin's test,\nso package.json's \"test\": \"moon run :test\" and \"lint\": \"moon run :lint\"\nscripts resolved to nothing for most of the workspace.\n\npackages/napi's build task ran plain `cargo build -p oxc-react-docgen-napi`\ninstead of the real build command (`napi build --platform --release\n--manifest-path ../../crates/binding/Cargo.toml --output-dir . --dts\nbinding.d.ts`, per its own package.json's build:napi script) — moon\nnever actually produced a usable native addon. Its inputs also pointed\nat nonexistent local src/Cargo.toml (napi is a JS/TS package, the real\nRust source lives in crates/binding and crates/core) — replaced with\nproper cross-project deps (crates-binding:build, core:build), since moon\ndoesn't support ../ parent-directory traversal in task inputs.\n\nVerified end-to-end: `moon run napi:build` now runs the correct command,\ncorrectly triggers its Rust dependencies first, and produces a working\nbuild. `moon run :test`/`:lint` now actually run something meaningful\nworkspace-wide instead of silently no-op'ing.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10\ngit log --oneline -2"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":228,"cache_read_input_tokens":623500,"output_tokens":587,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":228,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":623500,"cache_creation_input_tokens":228,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":228},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdMe853bJb1nppxbdZSK1","type":"assistant","uuid":"eedc6a49-2441-4505-b3c3-e4f54232730d","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:05:20.236Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
