{"parentUuid":"7826c994-4a40-45b7-8569-b78f9649067e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c5a617ab-e925-4f00-b112-70026e39294a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01524j7bjyjEgM9qcEeQERKv","type":"tool_result","content":"moon 2.3.3\nRun all affected tasks in a CI environment.\n\nUsage: moon ci [OPTIONS] [TARGETS]...\n\nArguments:\n  [TARGETS]...  List of explicit task targets to run\n\nOptions:\n  -f, --force                Force run and bypass cache, ignore changed files, and skip affected\n                             checks [env: MOON_FORCE=]\n  -i, --interactive          Run the pipeline and tasks interactively\n  -p, --plan <PLAN>          Relative path to an execution plan (JSON) in which to customize the\n                             action graph and pipeline [env: MOON_EXEC_PLAN=]\n  -s, --summary [<SUMMARY>]  Print a summary of all actions that were ran in the pipeline [env:\n                             MOON_SUMMARY=] [possible values: none, minimal, normal, detailed]\n  -h, --help                 Print help\n  -V, --version              Print version\n\nAffected options:\n      --base <BASE>        Base branch, commit, or revision to compare against [env: MOON_BASE=]\n      --head <HEAD>        Current branch, commit, or revision to compare with [env: MOON_HEAD=]\n  -g, --include-relations  Include graph relations for affected checks, instead of just changed\n                           files [env: MOON_INCLUDE_RELATIONS=]\n      --status <STATUS>    Filter changed files based on a changed status\n      --stdin              Accept changed files from stdin for affected checks\n\nWorkflow options:\n      --no-actions  Run the pipeline without sync and setup related actions [env: MOON_NO_ACTIONS=]\n\nGraph options:\n      --downstream <DOWNSTREAM>  Control the depth of downstream dependents [aliases: --dependents]\n                                 [possible values: none, direct, deep]\n      --upstream <UPSTREAM>      Control the depth of upstream dependencies [aliases:\n                                 --dependencies] [possible values: none, direct, deep]\n\nParallelism options:\n      --job <JOB>              Index (zero-based) of the current job [env: MOON_JOB=]\n      --job-total <JOB_TOTAL>  Total amount of jobs to run [env: MOON_JOB_TOTAL=]\n\nGlobal options:","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e6d189db-7c41-43c9-9da5-b77b01375af3","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:05:41.200Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"moon 2.3.3\nRun all affected tasks in a CI environment.\n\nUsage: moon ci [OPTIONS] [TARGETS]...\n\nArguments:\n  [TARGETS]...  List of explicit task targets to run\n\nOptions:\n  -f, --force                Force run and bypass cache, ignore changed files, and skip affected\n                             checks [env: MOON_FORCE=]\n  -i, --interactive          Run the pipeline and tasks interactively\n  -p, --plan <PLAN>          Relative path to an execution plan (JSON) in which to customize the\n                             action graph and pipeline [env: MOON_EXEC_PLAN=]\n  -s, --summary [<SUMMARY>]  Print a summary of all actions that were ran in the pipeline [env:\n                             MOON_SUMMARY=] [possible values: none, minimal, normal, detailed]\n  -h, --help                 Print help\n  -V, --version              Print version\n\nAffected options:\n      --base <BASE>        Base branch, commit, or revision to compare against [env: MOON_BASE=]\n      --head <HEAD>        Current branch, commit, or revision to compare with [env: MOON_HEAD=]\n  -g, --include-relations  Include graph relations for affected checks, instead of just changed\n                           files [env: MOON_INCLUDE_RELATIONS=]\n      --status <STATUS>    Filter changed files based on a changed status\n      --stdin              Accept changed files from stdin for affected checks\n\nWorkflow options:\n      --no-actions  Run the pipeline without sync and setup related actions [env: MOON_NO_ACTIONS=]\n\nGraph 