{"parentUuid":"9c2b9522-eda4-44a8-bfce-bfa806f0107f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c5a617ab-e925-4f00-b112-70026e39294a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018L2TNsHtoWjWMy8kM6vw8f","type":"tool_result","content":"Query information about moon, the environment, and more as JSON.\n\nUsage: moon query [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  affected       Query affected status for projects and tasks.\n  changed-files  Query for changed files between revisions.\n  projects       Query for projects within the project graph.\n  tasks          Query for tasks within the task graph, grouped by project.\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help     Print help\n  -V, --version  Print version\n\nGlobal options:\n      --cache <CACHE>              Mode for cache operations [env: MOON_CACHE=] [default:\n                                   read-write]\n      --color                      Force colored output [env: MOON_COLOR=]\n  -c, --concurrency <CONCURRENCY>  Maximum number of threads to utilize [env: MOON_CONCURRENCY=]\n      --dump                       Dump a trace profile to the working directory [env: MOON_DUMP=]\n---\nQuery for projects within the project graph.\n\nUsage: moon query projects [OPTIONS] [QUERY]\n\nArguments:\n  [QUERY]  Filter projects using a query (takes precedence over options)\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help     Print help\n  -V, --version  Print version\n\nAffected by:\n      --affected [<AFFECTED>]    Filter projects that are affected based on changed files\n      --downstream <DOWNSTREAM>  Include downstream dependents of queried projects [default: none]\n                                 [aliases: --dependents] [possible values: none, direct, deep]\n      --upstream <UPSTREAM>      Include upstream dependencies of queried projects [default: none]\n                                 [aliases: --dependencies] [possible values: none, direct, deep]\n\nFilters:\n      --alias <ALIAS>        Filter projects that match this alias\n      --id <ID>              Filter projects that match this ID\n      --language <LANGUAGE>  Filter projects of this programming language\n      --layer <LAYER>        Filter projects of this layer\n      --stack <STACK>        Filter projects that match this source path\n      --source <SOURCE>      Filter projects of this tech stack\n      --tags <TAGS>          Filter projects that have the following tags\n      --tasks <TASKS>        Filter projects that have the following tasks\n\nGlobal options:\n      --cache <CACHE>              Mode for cache operations [env: MOON_CACHE=] [default:","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7b4c6748-913b-4bf1-8faa-0672a175564a","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:06:01.968Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Query information about moon, the environment, and more as JSON.\n\nUsage: moon query [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  affected       Query affected status for projects and tasks.\n  changed-files  Query for changed files between revisions.\n  projects       Query for projects within the project graph.\n  tasks          Query for tasks within the task graph, grouped by project.\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help     Print help\n  -V, --version  Print version\n\nGlobal options:\n      --cache <CACHE>              Mode for cache operations [env: MOON_CACHE=] [default:\n                                   read-write]\n      --color                      Force colored output [env: MOON_COLOR=]\n  -c, --concurrency <CONCURRENCY>  Maximum number of threads to utilize [env: MOON_CONCURRENCY=]\n      --dump                       Dump a trace profile to the working directory [env: MOON_DUMP=]\n---\nQuery for projects within the project graph.\n\nUsage: moon query projects [OPTIONS] [QUERY]\n\nArguments:\n  [QUERY]  Filter projects using a query (takes precedence over options)\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help     Print help\n  -V, --version  Print version\n\nAffected by:\n      --affected [<AFFECTED>]    Filter projects that are affected based on changed files\n      --downstream <DOWNSTR