{"parentUuid":"f1fafe80-bbde-4260-9f3f-37e2ac2f16f6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c5a617ab-e925-4f00-b112-70026e39294a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NP2BuWikeK1XYQCni4B4XH","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"moonrepo GitHub Action setup-toolchain moon ci install action.yml 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - moonrepo/setup-moon-action: A GitHub action for installing moon globally and caching the toolchain. · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/moonrepo/setup-moon-action\"},{\"title\":\"Setup proto and moon toolchains · Actions · GitHub Marketplace · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/setup-proto-and-moon-toolchains\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - moonrepo/setup-toolchain: A GitHub action to setup and cache the proto and moon toolchains. · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/moonrepo/setup-toolchain\"},{\"title\":\"Workflow runs · moonrepo/setup-moon-action\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/moonrepo/setup-moon-action/actions\"},{\"title\":\"Workflow runs · moonrepo/setup-toolchain\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/moonrepo/setup-toolchain/actions\"},{\"title\":\"Continuous integration (CI) | moonrepo\",\"url\":\"https://moonrepo.dev/docs/guides/ci\"},{\"title\":\"moon v1.14 - Improvements to running targets and toolchain versions | moonrepo\",\"url\":\"https://moonrepo.dev/blog/moon-v1.14\"},{\"title\":\"Actions · moonrepo/moon-configs\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/moonrepo/moon-configs/actions\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - moonrepo/moon: A build system and monorepo management tool for the web ecosystem, written in Rust. · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/moonrepo/moon\"},{\"title\":\"Open source usage | moonrepo\",\"url\":\"https://moonrepo.dev/docs/guides/open-source\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about moonrepo's GitHub Actions for CI setup:\n\n## Key GitHub Actions for moonrepo\n\nThere are two main GitHub Actions available for moonrepo CI workflows:\n\n### 1. **setup-moon-action**\nA GitHub action for installing moon globally and caching the toolchain. This action caches the moon toolchain at ~/.moon (or ~/.proto), keyed by hashing the .moon/toolchain.yml configuration file found in the repository.\n\n### 2. **setup-toolchain**\nA GitHub action to setup and cache the proto and moon toolchains, which hashes .prototools and .moon/toolchain.yml files to generate a unique cache key. This action conditionally installs moon globally if the repository is using moon (attempts to detect a .moon directory), or moon-version is set.\n\nThe setup-toolchain action includes an auto-install parameter to auto-install proto tools by running proto install.\n\n## CI Workflow Usage\nFor GitHub, moonrepo recommends using their setup-toolchain action to install moon. Additionally, moonrepo suggests using their moonrepo/run-report-action for GitHub Actions CI, which will report the results of a moon ci run to a pull request as a comment and workflow summary.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"b31c678d-e100-48d7-b207-e39efb9f1762","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:08:52.365Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"moonrepo GitHub Action setup-toolchain moon ci install action.yml 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01FoHh9qauocDijhNjwuaXFf","content":[{"title":"GitHub - moonrepo/setup-moon-action: A GitHub action for installing moon globally and caching the toolchain. · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/moonrepo/setup-moon-action"},{"title":"Setup proto and moon toolchains · Actions · GitHub Marketplace · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/setup-proto-and-moon-toolchains"},{"title":"GitHub - moonrepo/setup-toolchain: A GitHub action to setup and cache the proto and moon toolchains. · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/moonrepo/setup-toolchain"},{"title":"Workflow runs · moonrepo/setup-moon-action","url":"https://github.com/moonrepo/setup-moon-action/actions"},{"title":"Workflow runs · moonrepo/setup-toolchain","url":"https://github.com/moonrepo/setup-toolchain/actions"},{"title":"Continuous integration (CI) | moonrepo","url":"https://moonrepo.dev/docs/guides/ci"},{"title":"moon v1.14 - Improvements to running targets and toolchain versions | moonrepo","url":"https://moonrepo.dev/blog/moon-v1.14"},{"title":"Actions · moonrepo/moon-configs","url":"https://github.com/moonrepo/moon-configs/actions"},{"title":"GitHub - moonrepo/moon: A build system and monorepo management tool for the web ecosystem, written in Rust. · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/moonrepo/moon"},{"title":"Open source usage | moonrepo","url":"https://moonrepo.dev/docs/guides/open-source"}]},"Based on the search results, I found relevant information about moonrepo's GitHub Actions for CI setup:\n\n## Key GitHub Actions for moonrepo\n\nThere are two main GitHub Actions available for moonrepo CI workflows:\n\n### 1. **setup-moon-action**\nA GitHub action for installing moon globally and caching the toolchain. This action caches the moon toolchain at ~/.moon (or ~/.proto), keyed by hashing the .moon/toolchain.yml configuration file found in the repository.\n\n### 2. **setup-toolchain**\nA GitHub action to setup and cache the proto and moon toolchains, which hashes .prototools and .moon/toolchain.yml files to generate a unique cache key. This action conditionally installs moon globally if the repository is using moon (attempts to detect a .moon directory), or moon-version is set.\n\nThe setup-toolchain action includes an auto-install parameter to auto-install proto tools by running proto install.\n\n## CI Workflow Usage\nFor GitHub, moonrepo recommends using their setup-toolchain action to install moon. Additionally, moonrepo suggests using their moonrepo/run-report-action for GitHub Actions CI, which will report the results of a moon ci run to a pull request as a comment and workflow summary."],"durationSeconds":8.478802709013223,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f1fafe80-bbde-4260-9f3f-37e2ac2f16f6","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
