{"parentUuid":"73fb06ba-021d-4cb8-a7f9-70686d520355","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdMeabjnTMB3XL59qEGdE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01R84nJqHWG77U25nY1o8hQJ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat(ci): skip untouched language groups via moon's affected-project graph\n\nCI ran the entire matrix (Rust lint/test/coverage/bench + TS Node matrix +\ninstall matrix) unconditionally on every push, regardless of what changed —\na docs-only commit paid the same cost as a resolver change.\n\nAdded a detect-changes job that queries moon's project graph (with\n--downstream deep, so a crates/core change correctly marks crates/cli,\ncrates/binding, and packages/napi as affected transitively — verified\nlocally against real diffs before wiring this in) and gates the Rust\njobs (lint, test, coverage, bench) and TypeScript jobs (typescript,\ninstall) on whether their language group is actually affected.\n\nDeliberately NOT gating `deny`: cargo-deny checks license/advisory\ncompliance against the dependency tree, which can change independently\nof any code diff (a newly-disclosed CVE doesn't need a commit) — gating\nit on \"did Rust change\" could hide a real finding on an unrelated PR.\n\nFails open by design: any error resolving the base ref, or the moon\nquery itself failing, defaults both language groups to affected=true\nrather than silently skip real checks. A missed unnecessary run costs\nCI minutes; a missed necessary one costs correctness.\n\nThis also required fixing crates/cli and crates/binding's moon.yml to\ndeclare their real dependency on core:build — without it, moon's\nproject graph didn't know cli/binding depend on core at all (no cargo\ndependency inference), so a core-only change wouldn't have marked them\naffected and their CI jobs would have been wrongly skipped.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10\ngit log --oneline -2"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":227,"cache_read_input_tokens":657545,"output_tokens":670,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":227,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":670,"cache_read_input_tokens":657545,"cache_creation_input_tokens":227,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":227},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdMeaXotnGskqPNLTFbxC","type":"assistant","uuid":"5acb7e08-9874-42cf-ad45-1dc15a90183b","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:11:20.582Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"5acb7e08-9874-42cf-ad45-1dc15a90183b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c5a617ab-e925-4f00-b112-70026e39294a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R84nJqHWG77U25nY1o8hQJ","type":"tool_result","content":"warning[unnecessary-skip]: skip 'oxc_str' applied to a crate with only one version\n   ┌─ /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/deny.toml:32:15\n   │\n32 │     { name = \"oxc_str\" },\n   │               ━━━━━━━ unnecessary skip configuration\n\nadvisories ok, bans ok, licenses ok, sources ok\n[main b06e303] feat(ci): skip untouched language groups via moon's affected-project graph\n 3 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\nb06e303 feat(ci): skip untouched language groups via moon's affected-project graph\n611d215 fix(moon): fill in missing task definitions, fix napi's wrong build command","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4124979e-4900-4b44-9731-713b23c3a283","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:11:27.454Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"warning[unnecessary-skip]: skip 'oxc_str' applied to a crate with only one version\n   ┌─ /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/deny.toml:32:15\n   │\n32 │     { name = \"oxc_str\" },\n   │               ━━━━━━━ unnecessary skip configuration\n\nadvisories ok, bans ok, licenses ok, sources ok\n[main b06e303] feat(ci): skip untouched language groups via moon's affected-project graph\n 3 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\nb06e303 feat(ci): skip untouched language groups via moon's affected-project graph\n611d215 fix(moon): fill in missing task definitions, fix napi's wrong build command","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"gitOperation":{"commit":{"sha":"b06e303","kind":"committed"}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5acb7e08-9874-42cf-ad45-1dc15a90183b","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version