{"parentUuid":"340c1860-113e-466d-a5f6-063ac5205b2e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdMecgQ8GQu1r5tMEvxac","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E5HB2FZ1v5juuUuZoghb8a","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/formatter.html","prompt":"What is the config file format for oxfmt (e.g. .oxfmtrc.json), how do you set print width / line width, and how do you install and run it via a CLI (npm/pnpm)? Also mention any options for including/excluding specific files or directories, and whether it supports per-glob overrides."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":447,"cache_read_input_tokens":658879,"output_tokens":382,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":447,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":382,"cache_read_input_tokens":658879,"cache_creation_input_tokens":447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":447},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdMecb7P7kXjpbYoKY9iY","type":"assistant","uuid":"0ff751a1-d4f4-4eae-bf5e-feb1049f6aac","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:11:45.168Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"0ff751a1-d4f4-4eae-bf5e-feb1049f6aac","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c5a617ab-e925-4f00-b112-70026e39294a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E5HB2FZ1v5juuUuZoghb8a","type":"tool_result","content":"# Oxfmt Configuration and Installation Guide\n\n## Installation\n\nOxfmt is installed as a dev dependency via npm/pnpm:\n\n```sh\npnpm add -D oxfmt\n```\n\nThen add scripts to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"fmt\": \"oxfmt\",\n    \"fmt:check\": \"oxfmt --check\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Config File Format\n\nThe documentation references a \"Configuration file reference\" but doesn't specify the exact config file name or format in the provided content. You'll need to consult the [Config file reference](./formatter/config-file-reference.html) for details on `.oxfmtrc.json` or other supported formats.\n\n## Print Width / Line Width\n\nThe content does not specify how to configure print width or line width settings in Oxfmt, suggesting this information exists in the detailed configuration documentation.\n\n## File Inclusion/Exclusion\n\nThe documentation mentions features for:\n- **Ignore files** - a dedicated page exists for this functionality\n- **Inline ignore comments** - also documented separately\n\nHowever, specific syntax for including/excluding directories isn't detailed in this overview.\n\n## Per-Glob Overrides\n\n\"Oxfmt now passes 100% of Prettier's JavaScript and TypeScript conformance tests.\" The documentation doesn't explicitly address per-glob configuration overrides in the provided sections.\n\n**Recommendation:** Consult the [Configuration](./formatter/config.html) and [Config file reference](./formatter/config-file-reference.html) pages for complete details on all settings."}]},"uuid":"e7a32c48-eb18-4821-97a9-d8700acb18b4","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:11:52.183Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":149296,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Oxfmt Configuration and Installation Guide\n\n## Installation\n\nOxfmt is installed as a dev dependency via npm/pnpm:\n\n```sh\npnpm add -D oxfmt\n```\n\nThen add scripts to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"fmt\": \"oxfmt\",\n    \"fmt:check\": \"oxfmt --check\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Config File Format\n\nThe documentation references a \"Configuration file reference\" but doesn't specify the exact config file name or format in the provided content. You'll need to consult the [Config file reference](./formatter/config-file-reference.html) for details on `.oxfmtrc.json` or other supported formats.\n\n## Print Width / Line Width\n\nThe content does not specify how to configure print width or line width settings in Oxfmt, suggesting this information exists in the detailed configuration documentation.\n\n## File Inclusion/Exclusion\n\nThe documentation mentions features for:\n- **Ignore files** - a dedicated page exists for this functionality\n- **Inline ignore comments** - also documented separately\n\nHowever, specific syntax for including/excluding directories isn't detailed in this overview.\n\n## Per-Glob Overrides\n\n\"Oxfmt now passes 100% of Prettier's JavaScript and TypeScript conformance tests.\" The documentation doesn't explicitly address per-glob configuration overrides in the provided sections.\n\n**Recommendation:** Consult the [Configuration](./formatter/config.html) and [Config file reference](./formatter/config-file-reference.html) pages for complete details on all settings.","durationMs":5139,"url":"https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/formatter.html"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0ff751a1-d4f4-4eae-bf5e-feb1049f6aac","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
