{"parentUuid":"75290d34-e586-4ad6-8b3c-faa0b272ee5d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdMedhhHwCbnCKJefx37c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HaVDXFMGss9v1CJDurtYoX","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/formatter/config-file-reference.html","prompt":"List the exact config file name(s) oxfmt looks for, the full JSON schema/keys it supports (especially printWidth or lineWidth), and any default values. Show a minimal example config file."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":951,"cache_read_input_tokens":659326,"output_tokens":192,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":951,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":192,"cache_read_input_tokens":659326,"cache_creation_input_tokens":951,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":951},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdMedd4z8HgQouaaG6jqZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"4cdefe8b-12e8-4d50-b328-cdc887a8e753","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:11:57.854Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"4cdefe8b-12e8-4d50-b328-cdc887a8e753","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c5a617ab-e925-4f00-b112-70026e39294a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HaVDXFMGss9v1CJDurtYoX","type":"tool_result","content":"# Oxfmt Configuration File Reference\n\n## Config File Names\n\nThe documentation does not explicitly specify the exact filename(s) that oxfmt searches for. Based on context clues mentioning `.editorconfig` overrides, it likely follows convention with names like `.oxfmtrc` or `oxfmt.config.json`, but this isn't confirmed in the provided content.\n\n## Full Configuration Schema\n\nOxfmt supports these top-level configuration keys:\n\n**Formatting Options:**\n- `arrowParens`, `bracketSameLine`, `bracketSpacing`, `embeddedLanguageFormatting`\n- `endOfLine`, `htmlWhitespaceSensitivity`, `insertFinalNewline`\n- `jsdoc`, `jsxSingleQuote`, `objectWrap`\n- `printWidth` (line length setting; default: `100`)\n- `proseWrap`, `quoteProps`, `semi`, `singleAttributePerLine`, `singleQuote`\n- `sortImports`, `sortPackageJson`, `sortTailwindcss`\n- `svelte`, `tabWidth`, `trailingComma`, `useTabs`, `vueIndentScriptAndStyle`\n\n**Special Keys:**\n- `ignorePatterns` - Glob patterns using gitignore-style matching\n- `overrides` - File-specific configuration overrides\n\n## Minimal Example Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"printWidth\": 100,\n  \"tabWidth\": 2,\n  \"useTabs\": false,\n  \"semi\": true,\n  \"singleQuote\": false,\n  \"trailingComma\": \"all\",\n  \"bracketSpacing\": true,\n  \"arrowParens\": \"always\",\n  \"endOfLine\": \"lf\"\n}\n```"}]},"uuid":"a9054e19-4f59-40b3-ac8d-860cee23a38d","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:12:06.178Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":216746,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Oxfmt Configuration File Reference\n\n## Config File Names\n\nThe documentation does not explicitly specify the exact filename(s) that oxfmt searches for. Based on context clues mentioning `.editorconfig` overrides, it likely follows convention with names like `.oxfmtrc` or `oxfmt.config.json`, but this isn't confirmed in the provided content.\n\n## Full Configuration Schema\n\nOxfmt supports these top-level configuration keys:\n\n**Formatting Options:**\n- `arrowParens`, `bracketSameLine`, `bracketSpacing`, `embeddedLanguageFormatting`\n- `endOfLine`, `htmlWhitespaceSensitivity`, `insertFinalNewline`\n- `jsdoc`, `jsxSingleQuote`, `objectWrap`\n- `printWidth` (line length setting; default: `100`)\n- `proseWrap`, `quoteProps`, `semi`, `singleAttributePerLine`, `singleQuote`\n- `sortImports`, `sortPackageJson`, `sortTailwindcss`\n- `svelte`, `tabWidth`, `trailingComma`, `useTabs`, `vueIndentScriptAndStyle`\n\n**Special Keys:**\n- `ignorePatterns` - Glob patterns using gitignore-style matching\n- `overrides` - File-specific configuration overrides\n\n## Minimal Example Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"printWidth\": 100,\n  \"tabWidth\": 2,\n  \"useTabs\": false,\n  \"semi\": true,\n  \"singleQuote\": false,\n  \"trailingComma\": \"all\",\n  \"bracketSpacing\": true,\n  \"arrowParens\": \"always\",\n  \"endOfLine\": \"lf\"\n}\n```","durationMs":6326,"url":"https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/formatter/config-file-reference.html"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4cdefe8b-12e8-4d50-b328-cdc887a8e753","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
