{"parentUuid":"680501e8-6a06-47c6-9046-3ad1bd9a051e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Explanatory"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"26716bf0-b15b-422f-950f-c5d972b1efd5","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:18:19.300Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"26716bf0-b15b-422f-950f-c5d972b1efd5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdMf8FDtP15vHTgwJEtUk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014mAVubGGrBMzpdrG2X9LQQ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat: replace prettier with oxfmt, 120-char width\n\njustfile's fmt recipe called `pnpm exec prettier --write .`, but prettier\nwas never a declared devDependency anywhere in package.json or\npnpm-lock.yaml — that command was silently broken (or worse, silently\nresolving to whatever happened to be hoisted, unpinned).\n\noxfmt (OXC's formatter): beta but real and actively used (v0.60.0, 30x\nfaster than Prettier, passes 100% of Prettier's JS/TS conformance\ntests, Prettier-compatible config). printWidth set to 120 to match\nrustfmt's existing max_width; semi/singleQuote match this codebase's\nexisting style (no semicolons, single quotes) rather than resetting to\nPrettier defaults and forcing an unrelated style change.\n\nScoped to explicit source globs, not a broad `oxfmt .` — that tried to\nreformat Cargo.toml, deny.toml, package.json, moon.yml, markdown docs,\nand the test fixtures under fixtures/** (deliberately-crafted files for\nextraction testing, not meant to be touched by a JS formatter), plus\nthe auto-generated packages/napi/binding.d.ts. An allowlist of the real\nhand-written source (vite-plugin's src/tests, napi's hand-maintained\nindex.d.ts, the cli npm wrapper, apps/validate's src) is more robust\nthan chasing every unwanted format oxfmt tried to touch via\nignorePatterns.\n\nReformatted the 9 files that needed it; verified vite-plugin's 18 tests\nstill pass and `tsc` still builds clean afterward — formatting must\nnever change behavior. Wired into justfile's lint/fmt recipes and a new\nCI format-check job (gated on the same typescript-affected flag as the\nother TS jobs).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10\ngit log --oneline -2"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":509,"cache_read_input_tokens":694082,"output_tokens":752,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":509,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":752,"cache_read_input_tokens":694082,"cache_creation_input_tokens":509,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":509},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdMf8AEWGr47bzopnj3Uh","type":"assistant","uuid":"c4af5779-021b-4e7b-99d2-2d40a86ec936","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:18:31.380Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"c4af5779-021b-4e7b-99d2-2d40a86ec936","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c5a617ab-e925-4f00-b112-70026e39294a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014mAVubGGrBMzpdrG2X9LQQ","type":"tool_result","content":"warning[unnecessary-skip]: skip 'oxc_str' applied to a crate with only one version\n   ┌─ /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/deny.toml:32:15\n   │\n32 │     { name = \"oxc_str\" },\n   │               ━━━━━━━ unnecessary skip configuration\n\nadvisories ok, bans ok, licenses ok, sources ok\n[main 4c79e73] feat: replace prettier with oxfmt, 120-char width\n 14 files changed, 395 insertions(+), 97 deletions(-)\n create mode 100644 .oxfmtrc.json\n4c79e73 feat: replace prettier with oxfmt, 120-char width\nb06e303 feat(ci): skip untouched language groups via moon's affected-project graph","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"74a6d8fc-b4ed-4629-bfe1-e56e73edc92a","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:18:35.509Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"warning[unnecessary-skip]: skip 'oxc_str' applied to a crate with only one version\n   ┌─ /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/deny.toml:32:15\n   │\n32 │     { name = \"oxc_str\" },\n   │               ━━━━━━━ unnecessary skip configuration\n\nadvisories ok, bans ok, licenses ok, sources ok\n[main 4c79e73] feat: replace prettier with oxfmt, 120-char width\n 14 files changed, 395 insertions(+), 97 deletions(-)\n create mode 100644 .oxfmtrc.json\n4c79e73 feat: replace prettier with oxfmt, 120-char width\nb06e303 feat(ci): skip untouched language groups via moon's affected-project graph","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"gitOperation":{"commit":{"sha":"4c79e73","kind":"committed"}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c4af5779-021b-4e7b-99d2-2d40a86ec936","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":