{"parentUuid":"30198574-8910-4e60-a04d-25c6bcbf4853","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"1","subject":"Fix moon.yml task definitions across all projects","description":"crates/core and crates/binding have empty moon.yml (no tasks). packages/napi's build task runs plain `cargo build -p oxc-react-docgen-napi` instead of the real `napi build --platform --release --manifest-path ../../crates/binding/Cargo.toml --output-dir . --dts binding.d.ts`. No project defines test/lint tasks anywhere except vite-plugin's test — so package.json's \"test\": \"moon run :test\" and \"lint\": \"moon run :lint\" scripts currently resolve to nothing for most of the workspace. Add correct build/test/lint tasks per project matching what justfile/CI actually run today.","activeForm":"Fixing moon.yml task definitions","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"2","subject":"Wire moon affected-detection into GitHub Actions CI","description":"ci.yml currently runs the full matrix (Rust lint/test/deny/coverage/bench + TS matrix + install matrix) unconditionally on every push, never calling moon. Depends on task #1 (moon.yml task definitions) being correct first. Use moon's affected-project detection so untouched projects skip their jobs.","activeForm":"Wiring moon affected-detection into CI","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"3","subject":"Replace prettier with oxfmt, 120-char width","description":"justfile's `fmt` recipe calls `pnpm exec prettier --write .` but prettier isn't a declared devDependency anywhere (pnpm-lock.yaml has no prettier entry) - likely broken today. Replace with oxfmt (confirmed beta but real/actively used, v0.59.0, Prettier-compatible, 30x faster). Configure printWidth 120 to match rustfmt's existing max_width=120 for consistency across the whole repo. Wire into justfile fmt/lint recipes and CI.","activeForm":"Replacing prettier with oxfmt","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"4","subject":"Add oxlint - pedantic for src, relaxed for tests","description":"No TS/JS linting exists anywhere in the repo today (no eslint, no oxlint). Add oxlint config: strict/pedantic ruleset for packages/vite-plugin/src, packages/napi (hand-written .d.ts + index.js), apps/validate/src; more lenient overrides for tests/**/*.test.ts (packages/vite-plugin/tests). Wire into justfile lint recipe and CI.","activeForm":"Adding oxlint config","status":"in_progress","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"5","subject":"Open GitHub issues for preset system and LSP server","description":"Two \"What's not built yet\" items from docs/STATUS.md - preset system (@oxc-react-docgen/presets, named PipelineOptions bundles, config-side only) and LSP server (lsp-types dependency exists, nothing built on it yet). Open as real GitHub issues on orin-dx/oxc-react-docgen for external visibility.","activeForm":"Opening GitHub issues for roadmap items","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":5},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9eb033c6-9749-4f69-9844-f0fe85b81a26","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:26:20.702Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
