{"parentUuid":"7f1e1bb3-c1e9-44ec-85d4-156c5de583d6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdMgRpo5NH9rFPfa2SStP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_read_input_tokens":800767,"output_tokens":701,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":701,"cache_read_input_tokens":800767,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdMgRkJD9TjkK7KcYfyPm","type":"assistant","uuid":"f5c2bdf4-59dc-4e92-8716-0ed32cd38b78","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:35:29.350Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"f5c2bdf4-59dc-4e92-8716-0ed32cd38b78","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdMgRpo5NH9rFPfa2SStP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All five tasks are done. Summary:\n\n1. **moon.yml gaps fixed** — every project now has real, working `build`/`test`/`lint` tasks; `napi`'s build task now runs the actual `napi build` command (was silently running the wrong thing); `package.json`'s `moon run :test`/`:lint` scripts actually work now instead of silently no-op'ing.\n2. **CI affected-detection** — added a `detect-changes` job using moon's project graph (with verified transitive-dependent tracking) to skip whole language groups when they're untouched; `cargo-deny` deliberately stays ungated since it's a security/license check, not a code-correctness one.\n3. **prettier → oxfmt** — prettier was silently broken (never a real dependency); oxfmt at 120-char width, matching the codebase's existing style (no semicolons, single quotes) rather than resetting to defaults.\n4. **oxlint added** — pedantic-strict for real source, relaxed for tests (via separate CLI invocations, since oxlint's config overrides can't scope categories per-glob — only individual rules). Tuned out ~19 rules that were pure noise against this codebase's conventions, then actually fixed every real finding that remained: two pieces of genuine dead code, unused imports, a nested ternary, inconsistent catch-variable names, and more. Verified zero behavior change by running the real `compare:all` pipeline before/after.\n5. **Two GitHub issues opened** (`orin-dx/oxc-react-docgen#1` preset system, `#2` LSP server), linked from `STATUS.md`.\n\nEverything is committed locally, verified with the full build/test/lint suite after each change. Two things from earlier are still your call, not mine: pushing this to the new remote (needs a force-push since the histories are unrelated), and whether to normalize the three different author emails across history before that push happens."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_read_input_tokens":800767,"output_tokens":701,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":701,"cache_read_input_tokens":800767,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdMgRkJD9TjkK7KcYfyPm","type":"assistant","uuid":"228a98bb-f662-4030-b606-133e79a0811c","timestamp":"2026-07-24T22:35:35.759Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
