{"parentUuid":"efc3350d-f590-42e2-8b1c-ac048d37ca21","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Explanatory"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"42a3b256-a759-4843-bf2d-0957a18188d1","timestamp":"2026-07-24T23:41:51.602Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"42a3b256-a759-4843-bf2d-0957a18188d1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdMmVmiydu9Px1r6F5AuC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KozsHSWBhkjbynaXSBHy5u","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(resolver): stop barrel resolution from exploring branching_factor^depth calls\n\nAdversarial review (Opus 5 + Fable 5 verifying Sonnet 5's findings)\ncaught a real P0: follow_reexports had MAX_REEXPORT_DEPTH as a recursion\nbound but no visited-set, so a barrel graph where multiple parents\nwildcard-re-export the same shared descendant — several sub-barrels all\nwildcarding a common types.ts, ubiquitous in real component libraries —\nre-explores that shared subtree once per path into it. Reviewer-measured\nwith real distinct files: 7 barrels took 9.7s wall time vs 156ms at 2.\nThis directly undermines the project's entire pitch (32ms cold\nextraction vs RDT's multi-second Program spin-up) on exactly the graph\nshape the barrel-resolution feature was built for.\n\nFixed by threading a visited: FxHashSet<(Utf8PathBuf, CompactString)>\nthrough the traversal — skip a (file, name) pair already explored from\na different parent. This also subsumes cycle detection (a cycle\nrevisits a pair by definition), though the depth cap stays as a second\nline of defense.\n\nAdded a regression test reproducing the exact failure shape (a barrel\ngraph deep enough to hit MAX_REEXPORT_DEPTH, querying a name that's\nnever declared anywhere so the unhappy path forces full traversal\ninstead of an early exit). Wall-clock time turned out not to be a\nreliable signal for a fast unit test — oxc_resolver's own path cache\nand this codebase's cheap per-call work meant even the unfixed version\nran under a second here. Added a #[cfg(test)]-only call counter instead\nand asserted on it directly: 511 calls without the fix (confirmed by\ntemporarily disabling just the visited-set check), 9 with it — matching\nthe reviewers' predicted branching_factor^depth vs linear-in-graph-size\ndifference exactly.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10\ngit log --oneline -2"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":369,"cache_read_input_tokens":894018,"output_tokens":823,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":369},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":823,"cache_read_input_tokens":894018,"cache_creation_input_tokens":369,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":369,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdMmVduS7ca2Bqe1onH7q","type":"assistant","uuid":"06d3ab9a-d51a-4d81-bd84-a9f6107caed1","timestamp":"2026-07-24T23:42:04.869Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
