{"parentUuid":"0e8a2398-5015-42ff-8076-5df8ddfa6924","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdN24dJmE1HZaNp9NgJUx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012ZLYzuCEc2y9BsZo41fmvE","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen\ngit add justfile .github/workflows/ci.yml\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(tooling): widen oxfmt/oxlint globs to close a real, present coverage gap\n\nAdversarial review flagged that justfile's ts_src/ts_src_only and\nci.yml's format job hardcode exact filenames (packages/napi/index.d.ts,\npackages/cli/bin/cli.js) instead of globs, and that\npackages/vite-plugin/vitest.config.ts sits outside every oxfmt/oxlint\nglob entirely. Checked and confirmed the gap is real today, not just a\nfuture risk: packages/napi/binding.d.ts already exists alongside\nindex.d.ts and was getting zero format/lint coverage.\n\nWidened to packages/napi/*.d.ts, packages/cli/bin/**/*.js, and added\nvitest.config.ts explicitly. Verified both globs still match cleanly\n(oxfmt picks up 12 files now instead of missing binding.d.ts; oxlint\nand `just lint` both still pass with nothing new flagged).\n\nLeft justfile and ci.yml as two separate copies of the file-list\n(rather than having ci.yml shell out to `just lint`) — that would mean\nadding `just` as a new CI toolchain dependency, which is a bigger\nfootprint change than this fix warrants on its own.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":802,"cache_read_input_tokens":138799,"output_tokens":858,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":802,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"outpu