{"parentUuid":"be748c25-c08f-4de4-b977-bdc43f686d64","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdN265nkSTUfSnbsjNgfd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G14v9Pq3x8NkiNwz3z5q63","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(resolver): remove dead recursion_limit, give named-type diagnostics location parity\n\nAdversarial review found two independent P3s in the same area:\n\n1. crates/core/src/lib.rs's #![recursion_limit = \"2048\"] was leftover\n   from the old derive-based PropType serialization (see ADR 0002),\n   which switched to a hand-written Serialize precisely to avoid this\n   attribute's need. ADR 0002 already documented in 2026-07-22 that\n   removing it was verified safe and flagged as a follow-up; this is\n   that follow-up. Confirmed again here: full workspace builds and\n   192 tests pass with it gone. Also corrected pipeline/mod.rs's\n   extraction_output_to_json comment, which still described the old\n   derive-based reasoning for living in core instead of the real one\n   (ADR 0002's manual JSON-building logic).\n\n2. resolver/chain.rs's \"Cannot resolve\" diagnostic (component prop\n   types) already surfaced where an import redirected to when it\n   differed from the naive name/consuming-file — necessary since\n   barrel/re-export resolution can land a name on a file other than\n   where it was written. resolver/named.rs's equivalent diagnostic\n   (nested/type-argument-level names, a separate code path) never\n   got the same treatment, so a redirected-but-still-unresolvable\n   nested type silently dropped the location context chain.rs's\n   diagnostics have had all along.\n\n   Factored the shared logic into unresolved_location_note() in\n   resolver/mod.rs (next to the existing max_depth_diagnostic() that\n   plays the same \"one guard, multiple call sites\" role) and call it\n   from both chain.rs and named.rs. Added a regression test\n   (test_unresolvable_named_type_reports_barrel_redirected_location)\n   using an Array<T>-style type argument to force resolution through\n   named.rs specifically — confirmed RED (diagnostic present but\n   missing the location note) before wiring the shared helper in.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10\ngit log --oneline -5"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":489,"cache_read_input_tokens":140714,"output_tokens":825,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":489,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":825,"cache_read_input_tokens":140714,"cache_creation_input_tokens":489,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":489},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdN263mDD1VVc33zQfEQB","type":"assistant","uuid":"0a4a7a01-7de6-4075-a0c3-6ec7ded382eb","timestamp":"2026-07-25T02:53:24.399Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
