{"parentUuid":"8ccf6fbf-2db7-4a7d-866a-ffecdcb34515","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdN276XRYKVyAxJtoWTGL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1260,"cache_read_input_tokens":141203,"output_tokens":1041,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1260,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1041,"cache_read_input_tokens":141203,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1260,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1260},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdN274sDSgqX9mtJ9Jukc","type":"assistant","uuid":"db915c14-46a0-462b-900b-09186c679a7d","timestamp":"2026-07-25T02:53:32.318Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"db915c14-46a0-462b-900b-09186c679a7d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdN276XRYKVyAxJtoWTGL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All P0/P1/P1b/P2/P2b/P3 findings from the adversarial review are now fixed and committed.\n\n★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────\nThe `unresolved_location_note` extraction here mirrors a pattern already established by `max_depth_diagnostic` in the same file: when two independent recursive code paths (`chain.rs` for component-level prop types, `named.rs` for nested/type-argument-level names) need identically-shaped diagnostics, factoring the *diagnostic construction* into a shared helper — not the recursion itself — keeps both paths free to diverge on actual resolution logic while guaranteeing user-facing messages stay in lockstep. It's a narrower, safer refactor than trying to unify the two resolution functions themselves.\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSummary of this session's remediation, in commit order:\n- **P0** (`b5b519b`): fixed the barrel-resolution exponential blowup with a visited-set, verified via a deterministic call counter rather than flaky wall-clock timing.\n- **P1/P1b/P2** (`72d7bfd`): fixed moon's affected-detection (was silently no-op-ing on every CI run since introduction), registered `packages/cli` as a moon project, fixed `defaultBranch`.\n- **P2b** (`2a5a7a1`): widened oxfmt/oxlint globs — confirmed `packages/napi/binding.d.ts` was actually uncovered today, not a hypothetical.\n- **P3** (`d4eed6f`): deleted the dead `recursion_limit` attribute (ADR 0002's own flagged follow-up), corrected a stale comment, and gave `named.rs`'s unresolvable-type diagnostic the same barrel-redirect location note `chain.rs` already had.\n\nOne P3 item was deliberately left alone: `deny.toml`'s graph-wide AGPL allowance (vs. scoping to just this workspace's 3 crates via `[[licenses.exceptions]]`) — the review's own synthesis downgraded this to \"not a real problem\" since the workspace already carries AGPL obligations itself, so I didn't make a change there.\n\nTwo things still need your explicit call before I'd touch them: pushing this branch to `orin-dx/oxc-react-docgen` (unrelated-history force-push), and whether to normalize the three different git-history author emails before that push."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1260,"cache_read_input_tokens":141203,"output_tokens":1041,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1260,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1041,"cache_read_input_tokens":141203,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1260,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1260},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdN274sDSgqX9mtJ9Jukc","type":"assistant","uuid":"6d9beab6-f022-4da8-a2de-1ab8ad5f479a","timestamp":"2026-07-25T02:53:41.268Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
