{"parentUuid":"8407e026-0017-4a4b-a3c6-62aa204336ea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPGY3u16kjj4tydC9qmj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ran a check across every markdown file (skipping code fences, list/table blocks, and YAML frontmatter, which aren't \"wrapped prose\"). Found one real case and fixed it:\n\n- **`README.md`** — the CLI section's opening paragraph was hard-wrapped across 3 lines; joined into one logical line. ✓ Fixed.\n- **`ARCHITECTURE.md`** / **`docs/type-checker-integration.md`** — flagged by my heuristic but false positives: an intro sentence immediately followed by a bullet list (valid Markdown, each bullet is its own complete line, not a wrapped sentence). Left as-is.\n- Every other live doc (`CONTRIBUTING.md`, `MIGRATING.md`, `docs/STATUS.md`, `docs/adr/*.md`, `docs/rdt-coverage.md`, all `CLAUDE.md` files) is already clean — the earlier \"stop hard-wrapping markdown\" work (commit `6f838f8`) covered them.\n\nThe only genuinely wrapped files left are under `docs/archive/*.md` — frozen historical planning docs from before that convention existed. Since \"archived\" was itself a deliberate decision to freeze them as historical record, I left those alone rather than assume you want them rewritten too."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1277,"cache_read_input_tokens":179904,"output_tokens":870,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1277,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":870,"cache_read_input_tokens":179904,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1277,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1277},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdPGXzEVHa