{"parentUuid":"620e8365-f3a1-4898-9fae-30b27269c7e4","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Explanatory"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3b3c09de-7482-4358-99f1-dcd3371a7a8c","timestamp":"2026-07-25T18:46:34.393Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"3b3c09de-7482-4358-99f1-dcd3371a7a8c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPGnaMiZPJSwiyGR5iu9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Markdown un-wrapping is done and committed.\n\n★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────\nThe first automated pass here is a good example of why \"leave it alone if uncertain\" beats \"aggressively normalize\" for prose transforms: my initial heuristic only rejected a block if *every* line matched a list/blockquote/hard-break pattern, so a block that mixed prose with structure (an intro sentence right above a bullet list, or a multi-line blockquote) slipped through and got flattened into garbage. Switching to *any* line matching → skip the whole block is strictly safer for a mechanical script that can't understand intent, even though it means a few genuinely-wrappable edge cases get conservatively left alone.\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nNow, on your benchmarking request — that's a substantial deliverable (proper output-quality diffing against RDT and react-docgen, real performance numbers, and an honest shortcomings/roadmap writeup), not a quick follow-up. Before I start building it, a few things shape the approach:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1196,"cache_read_input_tokens":212233,"output_tokens":1123,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1196,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1123,"cache_read_input_tokens":212233,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1196,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1196},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdPGnYQPpPKLd8Jou5pvG","type":"assistant","uuid":"5f28c7b9-4ec1-4334-982f-32bbf66a63da","timestamp":"2026-07-25T18:46:41.378Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"5f28c7b9-4ec1-4334-982f-32bbf66a63da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPGnaMiZPJSwiyGR5iu9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WMQ21CrofmK17XTi6MwU51","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"Where should the benchmark results live and how should they be delivered?","header":"Output format","options":[{"label":"docs/benchmarks.md (Recommended)","description":"A committed, versioned markdown report in the repo — tracks over time via git history, matches this repo's existing docs/ convention (STATUS.md, rdt-coverage.md)"},{"label":"Generated HTML artifact","description":"A one-off shareable page (charts, tables) via the Artifact tool — nicer to look at, but not version-controlled or auto-regenerable"},{"label":"Both","description":"Commit the markdown as source of truth, and also publish a nicer-looking HTML view of it"}]},{"question":"What should count as \"performance,\" concretely?","header":"Perf scope","options":[{"label":"Cold extraction wall-clock only (Recommended)","description":"Time to extract all fixture components from a clean process start — the number that matters for CI/build-time and initial Storybook startup"},{"label":"Cold + incremental/watch-mode latency","description":"Also measure single-file re-extraction time (relevant to HMR/dev-server feel), doubling the harness work"},{"label":"Cold + memory/peak RSS","description":"Also track peak memory during extraction, relevant for large monorepos but harder to measure fairly across three different language runtimes"}]},{"question":"\"Quality of output\" needs a concrete measurement, not just prose. What should be the primary metric?","header":"Quality metric","options":[{"label":"Prop-level agreement rate vs RDT (Recommended)","description":"For each fixture where RDT can run at all: % of props where name/type/required/default all match RDT exactly — apps/validate's compare:all harness already computes something close to this"},{"label":"Agreement rate + a taxonomy of divergences","description":"Same metric, plus every mismatch bucketed into categories (e.g. \"union discriminant not detected\", \"generic arg dropped\") so the shortcomings section is backed by counted evidence, not anecdotes"}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1196,"cache_read_input_tokens":212233,"output_tokens":1123,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1196,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1123,"cache_read_input_tokens":212233,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1196,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1196},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdPGnYQPpPKLd8Jou5pvG","type":"assistant","uuid":"4cde4c60-92fa-4b64-b53a-5fe6edf0b116","timestamp":"2026-07-25T18:46:50.313Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
