{"parentUuid":"aa6a2d5a-c21d-47f9-b17f-854f9497a6c6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Explanatory"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"05abf28d-ed11-44ab-838a-0b403e982b48","timestamp":"2026-07-25T19:26:16.446Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"05abf28d-ed11-44ab-838a-0b403e982b48","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPKpBafKcu45Ln4KoWnK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`docs/benchmarks.md` is written and committed (`67e0732`). Headline results:\n\n**Performance:** ~50ms cold extraction across all 21 fixture libraries (direct binary), 3.5× faster than `react-docgen-typescript` even under a harness that adds equal overhead to all three tools, and incremental single-file updates at ~1.7-2ms — a capability RDT/react-docgen simply don't have (no incremental API at all).\n\n**Quality:** real per-prop agreement rates (16% vs RDT, 23.5% vs react-docgen) rather than the old raw coverage ratio — and I found the low numbers were mostly measurement bugs, not real gaps: RDT stores union types under a different field than I first read, react-docgen stores real TS types under `.tsType.raw` not `.type`, and comparing against RDT's always-full HTML-attribute expansion or react-docgen's zero-inheritance-resolution needed matching HTML-attribute modes on our side. After fixing those, the numbers are trustworthy, and I root-caused several real outlier components — including one new, actionable gap (generic `SVGAttributes<T>` not being element-mapped) that doesn't need a type checker to fix.\n\nI also found `react-docgen` returns **zero props for 8 of 19** comparable components — a genuine, quantified example of \"what we can provide that they can't,\" alongside structured diagnostics (81 typed codes with help text) and `.d.ts`-only fixture support neither comparator can touch at all.\n\nWhat's next isn't decided by me: the shortcomings section flags one quick actionable fix (SVGAttributes/HTMLProps mapping) and three unexplained outlier components (`fluentui`, `base-ui/MenuTrigger`, `headlessui/Listbox`) that need the same manual trace I did for the others."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":441,"cache_read_input_tokens":370892,"output_tokens":608,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":441,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":608,"cache_read_input_tokens":370892,"cache_creation_input_tokens":441,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":441},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdPKp8h2cerP4kXzs7DXo","type":"assistant","uuid":"e5ff1ae8-34a6-4bfa-bc57-e94a35605b81","timestamp":"2026-07-25T19:26:25.527Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
