{"parentUuid":"f5702c56-ecd2-42f3-b1e1-14ef8125fe44","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Explanatory"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"07503d07-42b3-46b6-825d-31a872d616ab","timestamp":"2026-07-25T19:38:44.335Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"07503d07-42b3-46b6-825d-31a872d616ab","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPLmJdbqetLhnBeirDWM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UP2RQfbxUzB2Whdo5e5oAc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat(oxfmt): enforce markdown formatting (proseWrap: never) across the whole repo\n\nManual sweeps this session (README.md, docs/archive/*.md) fixed\nhard-wrapped prose by hand, but that's a one-time fix, not an\nenforced convention — nothing stopped it regressing on the next edit.\noxfmt has real, built-in markdown support via `proseWrap`, matching\nPrettier's semantics: \"never\" collapses every prose paragraph to a\nsingle line and relies on editor soft-wrap, which is exactly the\n\"never wrapped\" invariant wanted here — not a hand-rolled heuristic.\n\nAdded `proseWrap: \"never\"` to .oxfmtrc.json and ran oxfmt across\nevery .md file in the repo (45 files, all now enforced). Beyond\nprose-wrapping, this also picked up two real, independently-verifiable\nimprovements:\n- .claude/skills/rustdoc/SKILL.md had a code fence containing a nested\n  ``` block without enough backticks to escape it (needed ```` to\n  correctly contain the inner fence) — a latent CommonMark-parsing bug\n  that GitHub's lenient renderer happened to paper over.\n- Every table's separator row is now the canonical `| --- |` form and\n  every list gets a blank line before it — the second is a real\n  CommonMark requirement (a list immediately following a paragraph\n  with no blank line is ambiguous — some strict parsers render it as\n  a continuation of the paragraph, not a list), not just cosmetic.\n\nWired into `just lint`/`just fmt` and ci.yml's `format` job so this is\nnow a checked invariant, not a manual pass. Since markdown isn't\ntracked by moon's project graph, added a separate `docs` output to\ndetect-changes (plain `git diff --name-only -- '*.md'`, independent of\nthe moon-based rust/typescript detection) so a docs-only PR still gets\nthis check instead of silently skipping it under the existing\ntypescript-only gate.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":431,"cache_read_input_tokens":411498,"output_tokens":819,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":431,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":819,"cache_read_input_tokens":411498,"cache_creation_input_tokens":431,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":431},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdPLmGB1wmT4K9aRJLk6P","type":"assistant","uuid":"3ca78b1f-8f48-4508-b37f-1586dcecc1d5","timestamp":"2026-07-25T19:38:56.034Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
