{"parentUuid":"efd0d8da-f5bd-452b-ba6e-1321ab66dbfd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPMn6awxuokpGkqxKMgT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PfLNM3R6TDGUgAkUBcDoJg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen\ngit add crates/core/src/pipeline/mod.rs\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(pipeline): stop silently dropping components with the same name AND file stem\n\nFound while investigating one of docs/benchmarks.md's \"not yet\nroot-caused\" outliers (fluentui/Button): it wasn't a resolver gap at\nall — the component was extracted correctly (verified via a\nsingle-directory invocation) but vanished entirely the moment fixtures/\nwas extracted as one multi-directory invocation, the only way this\ntool is realistically ever run (any real monorepo has more than one\nsource directory; apps/validate always did too).\n\nRoot cause: Phase 5's duplicate-display-name handling disambiguates\nthe 2nd+ occurrence of a name with `\"{name} ({file_stem})\"`, but\nfile_stem isn't unique across different src_dirs — 5 of this repo's\nown 21 fixture libraries (chakra, fluentui, mantine, mui, panda) each\nship a component literally named \"Button\" in a file literally named\n\"Button.tsx\"/\"Button.d.ts\"/\"button.tsx\". All 5 landed on the identical\ndisambiguated key too, so each one silently overwrote the previous in\nthe output BTreeMap — with zero diagnostic, violating this project's\nown non-negotiable #6 (\"always emit a Diagnostic when degrading —\nnever fail silently\"). Confirmed by diffing combined-run output\nagainst the sum of 21 single-directory runs: 45 vs 49 components,\nexactly the 5 missing \"Button\"s (plus panda's own separate count).\n\nFixed by disambiguating with the full file path instead of the bare\nstem — always unique per file, so two distinct files can no longer\nproduce the same fallback key (only a genuine duplicate declaration of\nthe same name *within* the same file would still collide, a\nmaterially different and much rarer case than \"two different libraries\nboth named their button file Button\").\n\nAdded test_same_display_name_across_files_with_identical_stem_does_not_collide,\nconfirmed RED first (3 same-named/same-stem components across 3\nsrc_dirs collapsed to 2). Confirmed against the real corpus post-fix:\n`extract --src fixtures` (all 21 libraries, one invocation) now finds\n50 components instead of 45, with all 10 \"Button\"-named components\nacross the corpus present under distinct keys.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":441,"cache_read_input_tokens":480930,"output_tokens":930,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":441,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":930,"cache_read_input_tokens":480930,"cache_creation_input_tokens":441,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":441},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdPMn3JWS4K8y7g4SsBX6","type":"assistant","uuid":"f01a0c93-c70b-4a0c-81f0-a92cde62f124","timestamp":"2026-07-25T19:52:14.916Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
