y the 10 outlier components above, where this tool resolves far fewer props to begin with, so any prop it does share tends to also show as a residual `Named` reference rather than the fully-expanded structural type RDT prints |","+| `union-member-order` | 294 | same union members, different order — cosmetic, not a real disagreement, but counted as a mismatch since exact-string comparison can't tell \"same set, different order\" from \"different set\" without this explicit check |"," | `literal-narrowed-vs-widened` | 1 | one side kept a string-literal union, the other widened to `string` |"," | `optional-undefined-representation` | 0 | n/a for this pair |"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cf18e725-a6d0-4ccc-a564-a93fa0dc1c44","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/apps/validate","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
