{"parentUuid":"2d892e65-680c-4b33-996a-e553b2e0df78","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0cb60a71-2d64-41e9-8fe3-12f3a2549892","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KYCApiRcrfUcDx2hRYULYZ","type":"tool_result","content":"/// Parse a user-supplied react-version string (\"react18\"/\"react19\") into a\n/// `ReactVersion`. Returns `Err` (the original string, for a caller to build\n/// its own error message from) for anything else — a typo like \"react20\" or\n/// \"React18\" must not silently fall back to react19, the same \"never fail\n/// silently\" rule this crate's non-negotiables apply everywhere else. Shared\n/// by every caller that accepts this string (CLI flag, docgen.config.ts,\n/// NAPI options) so there's exactly one place this mapping can drift.\npub fn parse_react_version(s: &str) -> Result<ReactVersion, &str> {","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"24ea0dfe-113a-430c-b48c-deb033c53ae1","timestamp":"2026-07-25T20:03:04.671Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/// Parse a user-supplied react-version string (\"react18\"/\"react19\") into a\n/// `ReactVersion`. Returns `Err` (the original string, for a caller to build\n/// its own error message from) for anything else — a typo like \"react20\" or\n/// \"React18\" must not silently fall back to react19, the same \"never fail\n/// silently\" rule this crate's non-negotiables apply everywhere else. Shared\n/// by every caller that accepts this string (CLI flag, docgen.config.ts,\n/// NAPI options) so there's exactly one place this mapping can drift.\npub fn parse_react_version(s: &str) -> Result<ReactVersion, &str> {","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2d892e65-680c-4b33-996a-e553b2e0df78","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightf