{"parentUuid":"25515ac7-9b6e-4636-96c8-a4b51fbac754","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPNxjJD4oJbp69vi2ci8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Summary of everything from this round:\n\n**Wrap-width confirmation**: `.rustfmt.toml` (120) and `.oxfmtrc.json` (120) already agree; clippy has no width setting to configure (it's a linter, not a formatter).\n\n**Fixes to identified issues**:\n- Generic `SVGAttributes<T>`/`HTMLProps<T>` extends now resolve to their real element (`Icon`: 2→487 props, `Box`: 2→381)\n- Found and fixed a more serious bug while investigating: components silently collided across files sharing a basename in multi-directory extraction (45→50 components recovered, zero diagnostics were emitted for the loss — a real violation of the project's own rules)\n- Root-caused all previously-unexplained outliers (`fluentui`, `base-ui/MenuTrigger`, `headlessui/Listbox`) — all trace to the same already-documented \"needs a type checker\" boundary, no new gaps\n- `docs/benchmarks.md` updated with real post-fix numbers and clarification on why a single agreement-rate percentage can mean two opposite things depending on the comparator\n\n**Markdown**: `proseWrap: never` enforced repo-wide via oxfmt, wired into `just lint`/CI so it can't regress; also fixed a genuine CommonMark nesting bug it caught along the way.\n\n**Comment sweep**: three parallel audits found the codebase already close to the target style (zero AI-slop, zero word-salad). Fixed a stale citation bug (5 comments pointing at the wrong `CLAUDE.md`), cut ~15 restates-the-code-below comments, deduped one repeated rationale, and deleted one genuinely dead type instead of just polishing its comments.\n\nEverything is commited, full test suite/clippy/fmt/lint/deny green throughout."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1438,"cache_read_input_tokens":578912,"output_tokens":710,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1438,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":710,"cache_read_input_tokens":578912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1438,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1438},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdPNxfo7Z6qiwc7qEs1F7","type":"assistant","uuid":"591077b3-e3eb-47a7-82f2-1b23cea89b0a","timestamp":"2026-07-25T20:07:42.714Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
