{"parentUuid":"85d751e1-bfb2-4232-9e82-fa51161ce23e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Explanatory"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c8a5bd72-6b4d-4b2d-88c3-e2ba687ab9a8","timestamp":"2026-07-25T20:08:27.114Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"c8a5bd72-6b4d-4b2d-88c3-e2ba687ab9a8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPP2k5wdY9fJTFNY1xxv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Working tree is clean — everything's committed. Here's where the benchmarks work actually stands:\n\n**Done and committed:**\n- `docs/benchmarks.md` — real, reproducible perf + quality comparison against RDT and react-docgen, replacing the old raw coverage-ratio number\n- **Performance**: direct-binary cold extraction (50ms), a fair harness-equalized 3-way comparison (hyperfine, still 3.5× faster than RDT once shared overhead is stripped out), per-fixture criterion benchmarks, and incremental-update numbers (~1.7-2ms, 10-13× faster than this tool's own cold cost — a capability RDT/react-docgen don't have at all)\n- **Quality**: real per-prop agreement rate + a type-diff taxonomy for both comparators (16.8% vs RDT, 22.7% vs react-docgen), with the honest caveat baked into the doc that those percentages mean opposite things depending on direction\n- **Two real bugs found and fixed** during this work, not just reported: the SVGAttributes/HTMLProps element-mapping gap, and the more serious cross-file component-collision bug in the core pipeline\n- **All outliers root-caused** — the three that were previously \"not yet investigated\" (`fluentui/Button`, `base-ui/MenuTrigger`, `headlessui/Listbox`) are now traced to the same already-documented \"needs a real type checker\" boundary as the Ariakit cases, so nothing in the report is unexplained anymore\n- A \"Shortcomings and remediation plan\" section distinguishing fixed-now / already-tracked-and-deferred / perf-not-correctness items\n\n**Genuinely still open** (both explicitly deferred, not forgotten):\n1. The `deny.toml` AGPL license-scope item — the review that found it downgraded it to \"not a real problem,\" so it was deliberately left alone\n2. Two unresolved decisions from earlier in the session that are unrelated to the benchmarks content itself: whether to force-push the rebased/author-normalized history to `orin-dx/oxc-react-docgen`, and whether to normalize git author emails further — both paused pending your review, nothing done since\n\nIs there a specific angle you want to revisit — new numbers, a different comparison, or one of those two pending decisions?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":581128,"output_tokens":765,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":697,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":765,"cache_read_input_tokens":581128,"cache_creation_input_tokens":697,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":697},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdPP2gPSosLh9Lq4KQbWx","type":"assistant","uuid":"27012119-5e32-4f03-be8f-2c0453748448","timestamp":"2026-07-25T20:08:39.965Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
