{"parentUuid":"ea83ae96-9ca3-44ba-a382-532bfdd50c9b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"03d4cbdd-7029-4e04-9b9b-1c6c4e4aec9b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017fHPmqQkfaYDSDGruec34s","type":"tool_result","content":"95\t\n96\t/// `methods` is always `[]` — this tool doesn't extract class methods, and RDT\n97\t/// consumers (Storybook's docgen addon) only ever read it for class components.\n98\tpub fn serialize_rdt(output: &oxc_react_docgen_core::types::ExtractionOutput) -> String {\n99\t    let mut map = serde_json::Map::new();\n100\t    for (name, entry) in &output.components {\n101\t        let props: serde_json::Map<String, serde_json::Value> = entry\n102\t            .props\n103\t            .iter()\n104\t            .map(|(k, prop)| {\n105\t                let obj = serde_json::json!({\n106\t                    \"name\": prop.name,\n107\t                    \"type\": rdt_type_json(&prop.prop_type),\n108\t                    \"required\": prop.required,\n109\t                    \"defaultValue\": prop.default_value.as_ref().map(|d| serde_json::json!({\"value\": d.value, \"computed\": d.computed})),\n110\t                    \"description\": prop.description,\n111\t                    \"parent\": prop.parent.as_ref().map(|p| serde_json::json!({\"name\": p.name, \"fileName\": p.file_name})),\n112\t                });\n113\t                (k.clone(), obj)\n114\t            })\n115\t            .collect();\n116\t        map.insert(\n117\t            name.clone(),\n118\t            serde_json::json!({\n119\t                \"displayName\": entry.display_name,\n120\t                \"props\": serde_json::Value::Object(props),\n121\t                \"description\": entry.description,\n122\t                \"methods\": [],"}]},"uuid":"e6aad861-a466-480f-a222-a1b2ecc971fd","timestamp":"2026-07-25T21:14:07.588Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/crates/cli/src/commands/extract.rs","content":"\n/// `methods` is always `[]` — this tool doesn't extract class methods, and RDT\n/// consumers (Storybook's docgen addon) only ever read it for class components.\npub fn serialize_rdt(output: &oxc_react_docgen_core::types::ExtractionOutput) -> String {\n    let mut map = serde_json::Map::new();\n    for (name, entry) in &output.components {\n        let props: serde_json::Map<String, serde_json::Value> = entry\n            .props\n            .iter()\n            .map(|(k, prop)| {\n                let obj = serde_json::json!({\n                    \"name\": prop.name,\n                    \"type\": rdt_type_json(&prop.prop_type),\n                    \"required\": prop.required,\n                    \"defaultValue\": prop.default_value.as_ref().map(|d| serde_json::json!({\"value\": d.value, \"computed\": d.computed})),\n                    \"description\": prop.description,\n                    \"parent\": prop.parent.as_ref().map(|p| serde_json::json!({\"name\": p.name, \"fileName\": p.file_name})),\n                });\n                (k.clone(), obj)\n            })\n            .collect();\n        map.insert(\n            name.clone(),\n            serde_json::json!({\n                \"displayName\": entry.display_name,\n                \"props\": serde_json::Value::Object(props),\n                \"description\": entry.description,\n                \"methods\": [],","numLines":28,"startLine":95,"totalLines":196}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ea83ae96-9ca3-44ba-a382-532bfdd50c9b","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"e6aad861-a466-480f-a222-a1b2ecc971fd","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Read","toolUseID":"toolu_017fHPmqQkfaYDSDGruec34s","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"terminalSequence\":\"\\u001b]777;notify;warp://cli-agent;{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"agent\\\":\\\"claude\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"tool_complete\\\",\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"oxc-react-codegen\\\",\\\"tool_name\\\":\\\"Read\\\"}\\u0007\"}\n","stderr":"/Users/gabe/.claude/plugins/cache/claude-code-warp/warp/2.1.0/scripts/emit-terminal-sequence.sh: line 82: /dev/tty: Device not configured\n","exitCode":0,"command":"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/on-post-tool-use.sh","durationMs":70},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6f1dea95-b788-441d-bf1e-37f30a0b4af6","timestamp":"2026-07-25T21:14:07.588Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"6f1dea95-b788-441d-bf1e-37f30a0b4af6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"nested_memory","path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/crates/cli/CLAUDE.md","content":{"path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/crates/cli/CLAUDE.md","type":"Project","content":"# crates/cli\n\nThin command layer — no extraction logic. Each command parses args and delegates to `oxc-react-docgen-core::pipeline`.\n\n## Layout\n\n```\nmain.rs              — Cli struct, Command enum, *Args structs, main(), init_tracing()\ncommands/            — one file per subcommand (extract, watch, inspect, check, completions)\nconfig.rs            — docgen.config.ts loading, maps to PipelineOptions\noutput.rs            — comfy-table formatting helpers\n```\n\n## Rules\n\nAll user-facing output goes through `output.rs` or the tracing subscriber — never `println!` in command handlers. Error display uses `miette`. Progress uses `indicatif`.\n\nConfig loading (`config.rs`) runs the user's `docgen.config.ts` via node+tsx. The config file path is passed via env var, not embedded in a shell string — command injection risk otherwise.\n","contentDiffersFromDisk":false},"displayPath":"crates/cli/CLAUDE.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"911acf58-a7bb-4672-87f1-d288e3848cf9","timestamp":"2026-07-25T21:14:07.631Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
