{"parentUuid":"2dddc081-70a1-45f4-b0c1-6a5cd2aeb098","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Explanatory"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b92c9a9c-1af5-44fe-9ee0-4ef376f2bc25","timestamp":"2026-07-25T21:17:13.223Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"b92c9a9c-1af5-44fe-9ee0-4ef376f2bc25","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPUGtsWW7vAxo56Vu3vS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QzmPbiU8K6HMT4jx34HokR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen\ngit add crates/cli/src/commands/extract.rs crates/core/src/pipeline/mod.rs crates/core/src/resolver/alias.rs\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat(resolver): surface unresolvable props via react-docgen's own `composes` field\n\nStop-gap for the type-checker-boundary gap docs/benchmarks.md\nquantified — not a fix for it (that still needs a real type checker),\nbut closes a real, separate gap: when the resolver hits a mapped type,\nconditional type, or other structurally-unresolvable props base, it\nalready builds the exact raw expression for a diagnostic message\n(resolver/alias.rs's `resolve_base_as_chain` final match arm) — but\nreturned a bare empty chain, so that information never reached the\nprops map. A consumer reading only `props`/`composes` (any real RDT or\nStorybook consumer) saw nothing at all for these components.\n\n`ComponentEntry.composes: Vec<String>` already exists specifically for\nthis — it's react-docgen's own documented mechanism for \"props come\nfrom this type, listed by name instead of flattened,\" already used for\na few known-opaque patterns (ThemingProps, etc.). It was never\npopulated for this dead end, and `composes` propagates correctly\nthrough intersection/union merges (`merge_parent` already extends it),\nso populating it at the one source point was sufficient.\n\nTwo independent fixes, since the field existed but wasn't reaching the\noutput at all:\n1. `resolve_base_as_chain`'s final arm: `ResolvedChain::default()` ->\n   `ResolvedChain::empty_with_compose(base.to_raw_string())`.\n2. `serialize_rdt` (crates/cli) never included `composes` in its JSON\n   output at all — added it.\n\nNo new type inference, no performance cost — this only fires on paths\nthat were already failing and already computing the raw text; on:\nby default (strictly additive, can't regress a currently-working case,\nmatches CLAUDE.md's \"never fail silently\" rule directly).\n\nConfirmed against the real corpus: base-ui/MenuTrigger and all 3\nheadlessui/Listbox components now surface their actual unresolvable\nexpressions (a mapped type, and two conditional types) via `composes`\ninstead of silent zero-prop output — 4 of the 10 outlier components\nfrom docs/benchmarks.md. The other 6 (Ariakit, ark-ui, storybook-\nemotion, fluentui) don't benefit: their failure happens upstream, in\ngeneric-alias substitution not matching the pattern at all, before\never reaching this dead end — a separate, larger piece of work.\n\nAdded test_unresolvable_intersection_member_records_raw_type_in_composes\n(pipeline) and rdt_output_includes_composes (cli), both confirmed RED\nbefore their respective fixes.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":698,"cache_read_input_tokens":676651,"output_tokens":1074,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":698,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1074,"cache_read_input_tokens":676651,"cache_creation_input_tokens":698,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":698},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdPUGqWbZi5g5MC9KLw4s","type":"assistant","uuid":"9547498f-a3ce-4deb-a898-ce1a3981041e","timestamp":"2026-07-25T21:17:27.987Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Pro