{"parentUuid":"889b1698-2268-4e7b-9b7e-2363c38e6af9","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Explanatory"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8470b363-b75a-4690-8811-7efbf212e4b6","timestamp":"2026-07-25T21:18:52.090Z","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"8470b363-b75a-4690-8811-7efbf212e4b6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPUQBeWVxC8N1J5hrnGt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Working tree is clean, everything committed.\n\n**Summary:**\n- Yes — RDT's real format has a native mechanism for exactly this: `composes: string[]` (\"props come from this type, named instead of flattened\"). It existed in our own `ComponentEntry` but was completely unused for the type-checker-boundary gap, and was even dropped entirely when serializing to RDT format.\n- The stop-gap costs zero performance: no new type inference, just recording text the resolver was already computing for its diagnostic message, instead of discarding it. Made it default-on since it's strictly additive.\n- Real result: `base-ui/MenuTrigger` and all 3 `headlessui/Listbox` components now surface their actual unresolvable expressions. The other 6 outliers don't benefit — their failure happens earlier, in generic-alias substitution not matching the pattern at all, which is real further work, not something this pass could reach.\n\nBoth fixes are committed with TDD tests (RED confirmed before each), full suite/clippy/fmt green, and the benchmarks report updated with an honest scope note rather than overclaiming the win."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":355,"cache_read_input_tokens":682728,"output_tokens":365,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":355,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":682728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":355,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":355},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011C