{"parentUuid":"8c25cd61-81a0-4941-bcc1-0896df0a3b68","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a1660bcf-696d-476b-9ca2-b0dc79ad750a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011N3E27T7z5gYDDgSKiLPJM","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"typescript-go tsgo official API release 2026 stable public API\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"TypeScript 7.0 Beta Arrives on Go-Based Foundation With 10x Speed Claim -- Visual Studio Magazine\",\"url\":\"https://visualstudiomagazine.com/articles/2026/04/21/typescript-7-0-beta-arrives-on-go-based-foundation-with-10x-speed-claim.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"What Breaks When You Upgrade to TypeScript 7 (tsgo) | by Krunal Kanojiya | Jul, 2026 | Medium\",\"url\":\"https://medium.com/@krunalkanojiya/what-breaks-when-you-upgrade-to-typescript-7-tsgo-614005afbbd0\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript 7.0 RC: The Go-Native Compiler Has Landed\",\"url\":\"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/typescript-7-0-rc-go-native-compiler-2026-upgrade-guide\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript 7.0 Goes Native in Go, TS 6.0 Breaks Defaults - DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/matheus_releaserun/typescript-70-goes-native-in-go-ts-60-breaks-defaults-3kb8\"},{\"title\":\"typescript-go module - github.com/microsoft/typescript-go - Go Packages\",\"url\":\"https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/microsoft/typescript-go\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript 7 (tsgo): 10x Faster Compiler in 2026 | Nerd Level Tech\",\"url\":\"https://nerdleveltech.com/typescript-7-native-compiler-tsgo\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TypeScript\"},{\"title\":\"Gitea\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gitea\"},{\"title\":\"Go (programming language)\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Go_(programming_language)\"},{\"title\":\"Go continuous delivery\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Go_continuous_delivery\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about TypeScript Go (tsgo) and the 2026 releases:\n\n## Release Timeline\n\nMicrosoft officially announced TypeScript 7.0 Beta on April 21, 2026. TypeScript 7.0 reached Release Candidate status as of June 18, 2026, with the stable GA release expected within about a month of the RC. TypeScript 7 went generally available on July 8, 2026.\n\n## Compiler Implementation\n\nThe beta is built on \"a completely new foundation\" created by porting the existing TypeScript codebase to Go while preserving the same type-checking behavior and semantics. Microsoft says the new implementation is \"often about 10 times faster than TypeScript 6.0.\"\n\n## Public API Status\n\nImportantly, regarding the stable public API: Microsoft has said plainly that a stable programmatic API is not coming until TypeScript 7.1, several months after the 7.0 release. This means that while TypeScript 7.0 became stable in July 2026, a stable programmatic API for tsgo won't be available until the 7.1 release.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"8dde58bf-f3c0-457d-9c75-f251f38133be","timestamp":"2026-07-29T18:41:37.078Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"typescript-go tsgo official API release 2026 stable public API","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_015STgaSnNFQrreQfraWDrUY","content":[{"title":"TypeScript 7.0 Beta Arrives on Go-Based Foundation With 10x Speed Claim -- Visual Studio Magazine","url":"https://visualstudiomagazine.com/articles/2026/04/21/typescript-7-0-beta-arrives-on-go-based-foundation-with-10x-speed-claim.aspx"},{"title":"What Breaks When You Upgrade to TypeScript 7 (tsgo) | by Krunal Kanojiya | Jul, 2026 | Medium","url":"https://medium.com/@krunalkanojiya/what-breaks-when-you-upgrade-to-typescript-7-tsgo-614005afbbd0"},{"title":"TypeScript 7.0 RC: The Go-Native Compiler Has Landed","url":"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/typescript-7-0-rc-go-native-compiler-2026-upgrade-guide"},{"title":"TypeScript 7.0 Goes Native in Go, TS 6.0 Breaks Defaults - DEV Community","url":"https://dev.to/matheus_releaserun/typescript-70-goes-native-in-go-ts-60-breaks-defaults-3kb8"},{"title":"typescript-go module - github.com/microsoft/typescript-go - Go Packages","url":"https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/microsoft/typescript-go"},{"title":"TypeScript 7 (tsgo): 10x Faster Compiler in 2026 | Nerd Level Tech","url":"https://nerdleveltech.com/typescript-7-native-compiler-tsgo"},{"title":"TypeScript","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TypeScript"},{"title":"Gitea","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gitea"},{"title":"Go (programming language)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Go_(programming_language)"},{"title":"Go continuous delivery","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Go_continuous_delivery"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about TypeScript Go (tsgo) and the 2026 releases:\n\n## Release Timeline\n\nMicrosoft officially announced TypeScript 7.0 Beta on April 21, 2026. TypeScript 7.0 reached Release Candidate status as of June 18, 2026, with the stable GA release expected within about a month of the RC. TypeScript 7 went generally available on July 8, 2026.\n\n## Compiler Implementation\n\nThe beta is built on \"a completely new foundation\" created by porting the existing TypeScript codebase to Go while preserving the same type-checking behavior and semantics. Microsoft says the new implementation is \"often about 10 times faster than TypeScript 6.0.\"\n\n## Public API Status\n\nImportantly, regarding the stable public API: Microsoft has said plainly that a stable programmatic API is not coming until TypeScript 7.1, several months after the 7.0 release. This means that while TypeScript 7.0 became stable in July 2026, a stable programmatic API for tsgo won't be available until the 7.1 release."],"durationSeconds":6.975105041980743,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8c25cd61-81a0-4941-bcc1-0896df0a3b68","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react