{"parentUuid":"f2201cde-d602-4adc-8e6b-19489f6d0aa4","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"We're researching whether tsgo/tsgolint could help close our type-resolution gap; conclusion is no viable path yet since TypeScript 7.1's stable embedding API isn't out until later this year. Next: return to normal dev work, no pending action needed.","timestamp":"2026-07-29T18:44:57.776Z","uuid":"7bf148df-9374-4052-8f4f-b35bbccb1df3","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
