{"parentUuid":"621268b1-fece-4a4c-8be0-5a7f2bd1e296","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cdi6GY2eH55xw98y4rP73","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1239,"cache_read_input_tokens":213888,"output_tokens":1217,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1239,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1217,"cache_read_input_tokens":213888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1239},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdi6GW4aGs9waX9EZu7Jh","type":"assistant","uuid":"28e7277b-48e7-4b2e-9ea3-52fe4aaaccc6","timestamp":"2026-08-04T17:19:58.837Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"28e7277b-48e7-4b2e-9ea3-52fe4aaaccc6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cdi6GY2eH55xw98y4rP73","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Phase 0 is done and written up in `docs/root-cause-analysis.md` (linked from `STATUS.md` and `edge-cases.md`).\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nThe most useful outcome here isn't the individual fixes — it's that 3 of 4 analysis agents refused to force a single story onto their assigned cluster and split it instead. The \"give up silently\" cluster turned out to be three unrelated root causes (resolver: an unenforced constructor; extractor: a missing signal channel that was never built; pipeline: three unrelated one-line bugs) even though all ~17 findings looked identical from the audit's symptom-level view (\"missing Diagnostic\"). That's the value of a dedicated root-cause pass over just triaging a flat findings list: it stops you from writing one \"add diagnostics everywhere\" mega-task that would've under-served the extractor (which needs new infrastructure) and over-engineered the pipeline (which just needs three bug fixes).\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\n**11 mechanism clusters, 7 standalone tickets, 2 new ADRs proposed** (panic-containment boundary, schema derivation — both drafted in the doc, to be finalized as real ADR files when implemented). Recommended execution order from the task breakdown: **#4 (panic containment) first** since it touches the most shared surface and nothing else depends on it being done a particular way, then seven groups that can run in parallel: {resolver constructor + precedence}, {extractor diagnostics + depth-tracking}, {pipeline discovery/merge}, {allocation caps + LSP hardening}, {TOON truncation}, {schema derivation}, {CLI exit-code contract}, plus the standalone fixes.\n\nThat's the shape for Phase 1. Given the scope — this is real implementation work touching most of the codebase — I'd suggest writing the actual implementation plan next (writing-plans skill) off this document, sized so each cluster is a TDD task with its own edge-case tests per your original ask, then executing via subagent-driven-development or a Workflow with worktree isolation for the parallel groups."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1239,"cache_read_input_tokens":213888,"output_tokens":1217,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1239,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1217,"cache_read_input_tokens":213888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1239},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdi6GW4aGs9waX9EZu7Jh","type":"assistant","uuid":"5db38625-9a59-4e5f-8328-cdd18e11db59","timestamp":"2026-08-04T17:20:07.177Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"5db38625-9a59-4e5f-8328-cdd18e11db59","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cdi6GY2eH55xw98y4rP73","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X2jspUrBjwdMkVRycaanKZ","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"How should we proceed with Phase 1 (turning this into an implementation plan)?","header":"Phase 1 kickoff","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Write the full plan now (Recommended)","description":"Use writing-plans to turn all 11 clusters + 7 standalone tickets into one detailed, TDD-per-cluster implementation plan doc, sized for parallel execution. You review it before any code changes start."},{"label":"Start with just cluster #4 (panic containment)","description":"Plan and implement only the panic-containment boundary first since it's the recommended starting point and touches the most shared surface — defer planning the rest until it lands."},{"label":"Re-scope first — not all 18 items need doing","description":"Some findings (e.g. NaN/Infinity round-trip, DiagnosticCode::Unknown) are low-priority/likely-unreachable. Triage which of the 18 are actually worth fixing before writing a plan for all of them."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1239,"cache_read_input_tokens":213888,"output_tokens":1217,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1239,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1217,"cache_read_input_tokens":213888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1239},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdi6GW4aGs9waX9EZu7Jh","type":"assistant","uuid":"f5c2145c-