{"parentUuid":"b8a76001-dc58-4db0-b979-7980a85a7121","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cdi8bKJg8oHDAJaHDKoDb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EAM3ybYvYHWEJqXP5uehHJ","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/root-cause-analysis.md","offset":176,"limit":20},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":898,"cache_read_input_tokens":297933,"output_tokens":157,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":898,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":157,"cache_read_input_tokens":297933,"cache_creation_input_tokens":898,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":898},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdi8bFjsTZKWZuR3Ss9iq","type":"assistant","uuid":"383cefd7-ab68-4682-8a46-939411a6789a","timestamp":"2026-08-04T17:50:27.389Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
{"parentUuid":"383cefd7-ab68-4682-8a46-939411a6789a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8cfd87e5-e489-465b-a51f-4926a8373775","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EAM3ybYvYHWEJqXP5uehHJ","type":"tool_result","content":"176\t## Phase 1 task breakdown\n177\t\n178\tGrouped by shared-file conflicts so independent clusters can run in parallel and conflicting ones get merged or sequenced.\n179\t\n180\t| # | Task | Files touched | Scheduling |\n181\t| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n182\t| 1 | Resolver give-up constructor discipline | `resolver/{mod,chain,func,collected,primitives,named,template}.rs`, new `resolver/opaque.rs`, `types/output.rs` | Sequential with #5, #8 (shared files) |\n183\t| 2 | Extractor diagnostic channel | `extractor/{mod,alias,visit}.rs`, `types/diagnostic.rs` | Sequential with #4, #7 (shared files) |\n184\t| 3 | Pipeline discovery/merge fixes | `pipeline/{discover,mod}.rs` | Sequential with #4 (shared `pipeline/mod.rs`) |\n185\t| 4 | Panic-containment boundary + ADR 0005 | new `panic_guard.rs`, `pipeline/mod.rs`, `plugin.rs`, `crates/binding/src/lib.rs`, `pipeline/watch.rs`, `types/diagnostic.rs` | **Do first if possible** — other tasks touching the same files should build on top of it |\n186\t| 5 | Allocation caps | `resolver/template.rs`, `cli/commands/lsp.rs` | Parallel-safe except vs #1, #6 |\n187\t| 6 | LSP scaffold hardening | `cli/commands/lsp.rs` | Merge with #5 (same file) |\n188\t| 7 | Extractor depth-tracking | `extractor/mod.rs` | Merge with #2 |\n189\t| 8 | Resolver precedence extraction | `resolver/mod.rs` or new file, `named.rs`, `chain.rs` | Merge with #1 |\n190\t| 9 | TOON truncation helper | `toon.rs` | Fully parallel, disjoint |\n191\t| 10 | Schema derivation + ADR 0006 | `cli/commands/schema.rs`, `core/types/*.rs` derives | Parallel-safe, additive derives only |\n192\t| 11 | CLI exit-code contract | `core/types/output.rs`, `extract.rs`, `check.rs`, `watch.rs`, `inspect.rs`, `main.rs` | Parallel-safe |\n193\t| 12 | Standalone fixes | `substitute.rs`, `watch.rs`, `cache.rs`, `types/output.rs` (`ParsedProp` ctor) | Each independently parallel; `watch.rs` and the `ParsedProp` fix should merge with #4/#1 respectively if scheduled concurrently |\n194\t\n195\t**Practical grouping for implementation:** #4 first (unblocks nothing else but touches the most shared surface), then {#1+#8}, {#2+#7}, {#3}, {#5+#6}, {#9}, {#10}, {#11}, {#12} — seven parallelizable units after #4 lands."}]},"uuid":"db46008d-5709-423a-9738-77a9dbe5d8aa","timestamp":"2026-08-04T17:50:27.451Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/root-cause-analysis.md","content":"## Phase 1 task breakdown\n\nGrouped by shared-file conflicts so independent clusters can run in parallel and conflicting ones get merged or sequenced.\n\n| # | Task | Files touched | Scheduling |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Resolver give-up constructor discipline | `resolver/{mod,chain,func,collected,primitives,named,template}.rs`, new `resolver/opaque.rs`, `types/output.rs` | Sequential with #5, #8 (shared files) |\n| 2 | Extractor diagnostic channel | `extractor/{mod,alias,visit}.rs`, `types/diagnostic.rs` | Sequential with #4, #7 (shared files) |\n| 3 | Pipeline discovery/merge fixes | `pipeline/{discover,mod}.rs` | Sequential with #4 (shared `pipeline/mod.rs`) |\n| 4 | Panic-containment boundary + ADR 0005 | new `panic_guard.rs`, `pipeline/mod.rs`, `plugin.rs`, `crates/binding/src/lib.rs`, `pipeline/watch.rs`, `types/diagnostic.rs` | **Do first if possible** — other tasks touching the same files should build on top of it |\n| 5 | Allocation caps | `resolver/template.rs`, `cli/commands/lsp.rs` | Parallel-safe except vs #1, #6 |\n| 6 | LSP scaffold hardening | `cli/commands/lsp.rs` | Merge with #5 (same file) |\n| 7 | Extractor depth-tracking | `extractor/mod.rs` | Merge with #2 |\n| 8 | Resolver precedence extraction | `resolver/mod.rs` or new file, `named.rs`, `chain.rs` | Merge with #1 |\n| 9 | TOON truncation helper | `toon.rs` | Fully parallel, disjoint |\n| 10 | Schema derivation + ADR 0006 | `cli/commands/schema.rs`, `core/types/*.rs` derives | Parallel-safe, additive derives only |\n| 11 | CLI exit-code contract | `core/types/output.rs`, `extract.rs`, `check.rs`, `watch.rs`, `inspect.rs`, `main.rs` | Parallel-safe |\n| 12 | Standalone fixes | `substitute.rs`, `watch.rs`, `cache.rs`, `types/output.rs` (`ParsedProp` ctor) | Each independently parallel; `watch.rs` and the `ParsedProp` fix should merge with #4/#1 respectively if scheduled concurrently |\n\n**Practical grouping for implementation:** #4 first (unblocks nothing else but touches the most shared surface), then {#1+#8}, {#2+#7}, {#3}, {#5+#6}, {#9}, {#10}, {#11}, {#12} — seven parallelizable units after #4 lands.","numLines":20,"startLine":176,"totalLines":196}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"383cefd7-ab68-4682-8a46-939411a6789a","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
