{"parentUuid":"1bef3131-00a0-45cf-aa62-e3faa08f44db","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8cfd87e5-e489-465b-a51f-4926a8373775","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SNatnpWxbyM3G7F92a3Vb5","type":"tool_result","content":"168\t\n169\t**Consequences:**\n170\t- A second hand-maintained trait impl per recursive enum whenever a variant is added — the same \"compiler won't remind you\" tradeoff ADR-0002 already accepted for `Serialize`, now doubled.\n171\t- Every plain-struct field addition is schema-correct automatically; only the three recursive enums need manual attention going forward.\n172\t- New dependency (`schemars`) — if that's undesirable, the floor-level alternative is a CI test that serializes a real fixture and validates it against the hand-written schema, catching drift without adding a dependency.\n173\t\n174\t---\n175\t"}]},"uuid":"bf1cc4fd-92f3-4a8f-9b73-921b7a61088e","timestamp":"2026-08-04T17:50:36.330Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/root-cause-analysis.md","content":"\n**Consequences:**\n- A second hand-maintained trait impl per recursive enum whenever a variant is added — the same \"compiler won't remind you\" tradeoff ADR-0002 already accepted for `Serialize`, now doubled.\n- Every plain-struct field addition is schema-correct automatically; only the three recursive enums need manual attention going forward.\n- New dependency (`schemars`) — if that's undesirable, the floor-level alternative is a CI test that serializes a real fixture and validates it against the hand-written schema, catching drift without adding a dependency.\n\n---\n","numLines":8,"startLine":168,"totalLines":196}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1bef3131-00a0-45cf-aa62-e3faa08f44db","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.220","