{"parentUuid":"7aca4ae3-bc92-4412-ad26-d11fc37a332c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cdi8cCB5nCAmVkhnaNYUe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015xsaBTU8KKCW8NChjX5a54","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/root-cause-analysis.md","old_string":"**Decision:** Derive `schemars::JsonSchema` on the plain output structs; hand-write matching `JsonSchema` impls for the three recursive enums, mirroring their existing hand-written `Serialize` impls. `cmd_schema()` calls `schemars::schema_for!(ExtractionOutput)` instead of building a `json!()` literal by hand.\n\n**Consequences:**\n- A second hand-maintained trait impl per recursive enum whenever a variant is added — the same \"compiler won't remind you\" tradeoff ADR-0002 already accepted for `Serialize`, now doubled.\n- Every plain-struct field addition is schema-correct automatically; only the three recursive enums need manual attention going forward.","new_string":"**Decision:** Derive `schemars::JsonSchema` on the plain output structs, including `OpaqueReason` (verified non-recursive, already using an ordinary `derive` for `Serialize` — not one of the hand-written cases despite ADR-0002's text suggesting otherwise); hand-write matching `JsonSchema` impls only for `PropType` and `CollectedType`, the two enums that are actually recursive and actually hand-write `Serialize` today. `cmd_schema()` calls `schemars::schema_for!(ExtractionOutput)` instead of building a `json!()` literal by hand.\n\n**Consequences:**\n- A second hand-maintained trait impl per recursive enum whenever a variant is added — the same \"compiler won't remind you\" tradeoff ADR-0002 already accepted for `Serialize`, now doubled. Scoped to 2 enums (`PropType`, `CollectedType`), not 3.\n- Every plain-struct field addition is schema-correct automatically; only the two recursive enums need manual attention going forward."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":422,"cache_read_input_tokens":300621,"output_tokens":738,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":422,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":300621,"cache_creation_input_tokens":422,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":422},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdi8cAKxeRJYUXe7zbaho","type":"assistant","uuid":"ff47f432-c3ce-48e3-840e-4e570d3f33f6","timestamp":"2026-08-04T17:50:43.261Z","effort":"medium","session_id":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen","sessionId":"d83be67f-8b07-459c-989b-529791ef5ca7","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"delightful-booping-fern"}
